      get:
        securedBy:
        - AdminToken
        - PlatformKey
        description: Everything about the shop, including the AI's design spec and guesses.
        responses:
          '200':
            description: The shop.
            body:
              application/json:
                schema: "{\n  \"id\": \"Shop\",\n  \"title\": \"Shop\",\n  \"example\": {\n    \"id\": \"Hn2c8QvL0xTzR4pW\",\n    \"slug\": \"vintageskates\",\n    \"status\": \"live\",\n    \"product_type\": \"physical\",\n    \"price_cents\": 24000,\n    \"currency\": \"USD\",\n    \"shipping_cents\": 1500,\n    \"ship_countries\": \"US\",\n    \"stock\": null,\n    \"delivery\": \"file\",\n    \"access_url\": null,\n    \"paypal_email\": \"seller@example.com\",\n    \"seller_email\": \"seller@example.com\",\n    \"paypal_merchant_id\": \"7MZJ4QXN8K2LA\",\n    \"paypal_status\": {\n      \"receivable\": true,\n      \"emailConfirmed\": true,\n      \"checkedAt\": \"2026-10-21T18:04:11Z\"\n    },\n    \"zapier_hook_url\": null,\n    \"in_gallery\": true,\n    \"account_id\": \"Vq3nN8cT0bLx2YwE\",\n    \"options\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Size\",\n        \"kind\": \"size\",\n        \"values\": [\n          {\n            \"label\": \"7\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"label\": \"8\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"label\": \"9\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"option_stock\": {\n      \"7\": 3,\n      \"8\": 0,\n      \"9\": 6\n    },\n    \"suggestions\": null,\n    \"photo_blob\": \"LFRvGuTU3D8i334X\",\n    \"gallery_blobs\": [\n      \"zrySajNyao6_j11x\",\n      \"SuqcgNv64HWN8H6e\"\n    ],\n    \"hero_blob\": null,\n    \"hero_status\": \"none\",\n    \"hero_error\": null,\n    \"ai_source\": \"gemini\",\n    \"source_url\": null,\n    \"referral\": null,\n    \"spec\": {\n      \"productType\": \"physical\",\n      \"productName\": \"Vintage Cream and Red Roller Skates\",\n      \"layout\": \"editorial\",\n      \"palette\": {\n        \"background\": \"#f6efe4\",\n        \"surface\": \"#fffaf2\",\n        \"text\": \"#2b1d14\",\n        \"muted\": \"#7a6455\",\n        \"accent\": \"#b3261e\",\n        \"accentText\": \"#ffffff\"\n      },\n      \"fonts\": {\n        \"heading\": \"Playfair Display\",\n        \"body\": \"Inter\"\n      },\n      \"eyebrow\": \"One pair, restored\",\n      \"headline\": \"Classic quad skates crafted with walnut burl heels\",\n      \"subheadline\": \"A vintage pair of skates featuring cream leather, bold red trim, and durable quad wheels.\",\n      \"story\": \"Each pair combines soft cream leather with distinct red accents and a sculpted walnut burl heel base.\",\n      \"bullets\": [\n        \"Handmade cream leather upper with rich red trim\",\n        \"Sculpted walnut burl heel structure for stability\"\n      ],\n      \"details\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Materials\",\n          \"value\": \"Leather upper, walnut burl heel, rubber wheels\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"faq\": [\n        {\n          \"q\": \"Are these suitable for outdoor skating?\",\n          \"a\": \"Yes, on indoor rink floors and paved outdoor paths.\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"ctaLabel\": \"Buy the skates\",\n      \"suggestedPriceUsd\": 240,\n      \"suggestedShippingUsd\": 15,\n      \"imageAlt\": \"Cream leather quad roller skates with red trim\"\n    },\n    \"created_at\": \"2026-10-19T15:22:08Z\"\n  },\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"id\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"slug\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"status\": {\n      \"title\": \"Status\",\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"additionalProperties\": false,\n      \"enum\": [\n        \"draft\",\n        \"live\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"product_type\": {\n      \"title\": \"ProductType1\",\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"additionalProperties\": false,\n      \"enum\": [\n        \"physical\",\n        \"digital\",\n        \"referral\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"price_cents\": {\n      \"type\": \"integer\",\n      \"format\": \"int32\"\n    },\n    \"currency\": {\n      \"example\": \"USD\",\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"spec\": {\n      \"id\": \"DesignSpec\",\n      \"title\": \"DesignSpec\",\n      \"description\": \"What Gemini designed. OneThing's templates render it; Gemini never writes HTML.\",\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"productType\": {\n          \"title\": \"ProductType2\",\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"additionalProperties\": false,\n          \"enum\": [\n            \"digital\",\n            \"physical\"\n          ]\n        },\n        \"productName\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"layout\": {\n          \"title\": \"Layout\",\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"additionalProperties\": false,\n          \"enum\": [\n            \"bold-hero\",\n            \"editorial\",\n            \"minimal\",\n            \"playful\"\n          ]\n        },\n        \"palette\": {\n          \"id\": \"Palette\",\n          \"title\": \"Palette\",\n          \"type\": \"object\",\n          \"properties\": {\n            \"background\": {\n              \"example\": \"#14171a\",\n              \"type\": \"string\",\n              \"pattern\": \"^#[0-9a-fA-F]{6}$\"\n            },\n            \"surface\": {\n              \"example\": \"#14171a\",\n              \"type\": \"string\",\n              \"pattern\": \"^#[0-9a-fA-F]{6}$\"\n            },\n            \"text\": {\n              \"example\": \"#14171a\",\n              \"type\": \"string\",\n              \"pattern\": \"^#[0-9a-fA-F]{6}$\"\n            },\n            \"muted\": {\n              \"example\": \"#14171a\",\n              \"type\": \"string\",\n              \"pattern\": \"^#[0-9a-fA-F]{6}$\"\n            },\n            \"accent\": {\n              \"example\": \"#14171a\",\n              \"type\": \"string\",\n              \"pattern\": \"^#[0-9a-fA-F]{6}$\"\n            },\n            \"accentText\": {\n              \"example\": \"#14171a\",\n              \"type\": \"string\",\n              \"pattern\": \"^#[0-9a-fA-F]{6}$\"\n            }\n          },\n          \"required\": [\n            \"background\",\n            \"surface\",\n            \"text\",\n            \"muted\",\n            \"accent\",\n            \"accentText\"\n          ]\n        },\n        \"fonts\": {\n          \"id\": \"Fonts\",\n          \"title\": \"Fonts\",\n          \"type\": \"object\",\n          \"properties\": {\n            \"heading\": {\n              \"type\": \"string\"\n            },\n            \"body\": {\n              \"type\": \"string\"\n            }\n          },\n          \"required\": [\n            \"heading\",\n            \"body\"\n          ]\n        },\n        \"headline\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"bullets\": {\n          \"description\": \"\",\n          \"type\": \"array\",\n          \"items\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"faq\": {\n          \"description\": \"\",\n          \"type\": \"array\",\n          \"items\": {\n            \"id\": \"Faq\",\n            \"title\": \"Faq\",\n            \"type\": \"object\",\n            \"properties\": {\n              \"q\": {\n                \"type\": \"string\"\n              },\n              \"a\": {\n                \"type\": \"string\"\n              }\n            },\n            \"required\": [\n              \"q\",\n              \"a\"\n            ]\n          }\n        },\n        \"ctaLabel\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"eyebrow\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"subheadline\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"story\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"details\": {\n          \"description\": \"\",\n          \"type\": \"array\",\n          \"items\": {\n            \"id\": \"Detail\",\n            \"title\": \"Detail\",\n            \"type\": \"object\",\n            \"properties\": {\n              \"label\": {\n                \"type\": \"string\"\n              },\n              \"value\": {\n                \"type\": \"string\"\n              }\n            },\n            \"required\": [\n              \"label\",\n              \"value\"\n            ]\n          }\n        },\n        \"suggestedPriceUsd\": {\n          \"type\": \"number\"\n        },\n        \"suggestedShippingUsd\": {\n          \"type\": \"number\"\n        },\n        \"imageAlt\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"heroPrompt\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"required\": [\n        \"productType\",\n        \"productName\",\n        \"layout\",\n        \"palette\",\n        \"fonts\",\n        \"headline\",\n        \"bullets\",\n        \"faq\",\n        \"ctaLabel\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"shipping_cents\": {\n      \"type\": \"integer\",\n      \"format\": \"int32\"\n    },\n    \"ship_countries\": {\n      \"type\": [\n        \"string\",\n        \"null\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"stock\": {\n      \"type\": [\n        \"integer\",\n        \"null\"\n      ],\n      \"format\": \"int32\"\n    },\n    \"delivery\": {\n      \"title\": \"Delivery1\",\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"additionalProperties\": false,\n      \"enum\": [\n        \"file\",\n        \"access_code\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"access_url\": {\n      \"type\": [\n        \"string\",\n        \"null\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"paypal_email\": {\n      \"type\": [\n        \"string\",\n        \"null\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"seller_email\": {\n      \"type\": [\n        \"string\",\n        \"null\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"paypal_merchant_id\": {\n      \"description\": \"The connected PayPal account (`connectPayPal`). Sales go here when it can receive payments.\",\n      \"type\": [\n        \"string\",\n        \"null\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"paypal_status\": {\n      \"oneOf\": [\n        {\n          \"id\": \"PayPalStatus\",\n          \"title\": \"PayPalStatus\",\n          \"description\": \"What PayPal last said about a connected seller account.\",\n          \"type\": \"object\",\n          \"properties\": {\n            \"receivable\": {\n              \"description\": \"The account can receive payments.\",\n              \"type\": \"boolean\"\n            },\n            \"emailConfirmed\": {\n              \"description\": \"The seller has confirmed their email with PayPal.\",\n              \"type\": \"boolean\"\n            },\n            \"checkedAt\": {\n              \"type\": \"string\",\n              \"format\": \"date-time\"\n            }\n          },\n          \"required\": [\n            \"receivable\",\n            \"emailConfirmed\",\n            \"checkedAt\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"null\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    \"zapier_hook_url\": {\n      \"type\": [\n        \"string\",\n        \"null\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"in_gallery\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"account_id\": {\n      \"description\": \"The seller account that owns the shop, if it was made while signed in.\",\n      \"type\": [\n        \"string\",\n        \"null\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"options\": {\n      \"description\": \"\",\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"id\": \"ShopOption\",\n        \"title\": \"ShopOption\",\n        \"description\": \"Something the buyer picks, such as a size or a colour. The shop still sells one product.\",\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"name\": {\n            \"example\": \"Size\",\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"maxLength\": 20\n          },\n          \"kind\": {\n            \"title\": \"Kind\",\n            \"description\": \"`color` shows swatches, and the photo of the picked colour.\",\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"additionalProperties\": false,\n            \"enum\": [\n              \"size\",\n              \"color\",\n              \"other\"\n            ]\n          },\n          \"values\": {\n            \"description\": \"\",\n            \"type\": \"array\",\n            \"items\": {\n              \"id\": \"OptionValue\",\n              \"title\": \"OptionValue\",\n              \"type\": \"object\",\n              \"properties\": {\n                \"label\": {\n                  \"example\": \"M\",\n                  \"type\": \"string\",\n                  \"maxLength\": 30\n                },\n                \"hex\": {\n                  \"example\": \"#14171a\",\n                  \"type\": \"string\",\n                  \"pattern\": \"^#[0-9a-fA-F]{6}$\"\n                },\n                \"photo\": {\n                  \"description\": \"Colours: the shop photo (id) that shows this colour. See `matchColorPhotos`.\",\n                  \"type\": \"string\"\n                }\n              },\n              \"required\": [\n                \"label\"\n              ]\n            },\n            \"minItems\": 1,\n            \"maxItems\": 12\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"name\",\n          \"kind\",\n          \"values\"\n        ]\n      }\n    },\n    \"option_stock\": {\n      \"description\": \"Stock per combination, keyed by its values in option order joined with ` / ` (e.g. `M / Black`). A missing key or `null` means unlimited; `0` is sold out.\",\n      \"example\": {\n        \"M / Black\": 4,\n        \"L / Black\": 0\n      },\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"additionalProperties\": {\n        \"type\": [\n          \"integer\",\n          \"null\"\n        ],\n        \"format\": \"int32\"\n      },\n      \"minimum\": 0.0\n    },\n    \"suggestions\": {\n      \"oneOf\": [\n        {\n          \"id\": \"Suggestions\",\n          \"title\": \"Suggestions\",\n          \"description\": \"What Gemini thinks buyers will want to choose or ask. The seller confirms; nothing is applied on its own.\",\n          \"type\": \"object\",\n          \"properties\": {\n            \"oneOfAKind\": {\n              \"description\": \"A single item (vintage, handmade), so options and stock don't apply.\",\n              \"type\": \"boolean\"\n            },\n            \"options\": {\n              \"description\": \"\",\n              \"type\": \"array\",\n              \"items\": {\n                \"id\": \"Option\",\n                \"title\": \"Option\",\n                \"type\": \"object\",\n                \"properties\": {\n                  \"name\": {\n                    \"example\": \"Size\",\n                    \"type\": \"string\",\n                    \"maxLength\": 20\n                  },\n                  \"kind\": {\n                    \"$ref\": \"ShopOption#/properties/kind\"\n                  },\n                  \"values\": {\n                    \"description\": \"\",\n                    \"type\": \"array\",\n                    \"items\": {\n                      \"$ref\": \"OptionValue\"\n                    },\n                    \"minItems\": 1,\n                    \"maxItems\": 12\n                  },\n                  \"fromSeller\": {\n                    \"description\": \"The seller's description or photo named these values; otherwise they're a guess.\",\n                    \"type\": \"boolean\"\n                  }\n                },\n                \"required\": [\n                  \"name\",\n                  \"kind\",\n                  \"values\"\n                ]\n              }\n            },\n            \"missingFacts\": {\n              \"description\": \"\",\n              \"type\": \"array\",\n              \"items\": {\n                \"id\": \"MissingFact\",\n                \"title\": \"MissingFact\",\n                \"type\": \"object\",\n                \"properties\": {\n                  \"label\": {\n                    \"example\": \"Size\",\n                    \"type\": \"string\"\n                  },\n                  \"question\": {\n                    \"example\": \"What size are the skates?\",\n                    \"type\": \"string\"\n                  },\n                  \"placeholder\": {\n                    \"example\": \"US women's 8\",\n                    \"type\": \"string\"\n                  }\n                },\n                \"required\": [\n                  \"label\",\n                  \"question\",\n                  \"placeholder\"\n                ]\n              }\n            }\n          },\n          \"required\": [\n            \"oneOfAKind\",\n            \"options\",\n            \"missingFacts\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"null\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    \"photo_blob\": {\n      \"description\": \"Image id for `getImage`. The cover photo.\",\n      \"type\": [\n        \"string\",\n        \"null\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"gallery_blobs\": {\n      \"description\": \"The other photos, in order.\",\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"string\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"hero_blob\": {\n      \"type\": [\n        \"string\",\n        \"null\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"hero_status\": {\n      \"title\": \"HeroStatus\",\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"additionalProperties\": false,\n      \"enum\": [\n        \"none\",\n        \"pending\",\n        \"ready\",\n        \"failed\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"hero_error\": {\n      \"type\": [\n        \"string\",\n        \"null\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"ai_source\": {\n      \"title\": \"AiSource\",\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"additionalProperties\": false,\n      \"enum\": [\n        \"gemini\",\n        \"fallback\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"source_url\": {\n      \"type\": [\n        \"string\",\n        \"null\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"referral\": {\n      \"oneOf\": [\n        {\n          \"id\": \"Referral\",\n          \"title\": \"Referral\",\n          \"description\": \"A recommended Channel3 product. Buy links are Channel3-tracked, credited to this shop.\",\n          \"type\": \"object\",\n          \"properties\": {\n            \"productId\": {\n              \"type\": \"string\"\n            },\n            \"title\": {\n              \"type\": \"string\"\n            },\n            \"offers\": {\n              \"description\": \"\",\n              \"type\": \"array\",\n              \"items\": {\n                \"id\": \"Offer\",\n                \"title\": \"Offer\",\n                \"type\": \"object\",\n                \"properties\": {\n                  \"domain\": {\n                    \"type\": \"string\"\n                  },\n                  \"url\": {\n                    \"type\": \"string\"\n                  },\n                  \"price\": {\n                    \"type\": \"number\"\n                  },\n                  \"currency\": {\n                    \"type\": \"string\"\n                  },\n                  \"inStock\": {\n                    \"type\": \"boolean\"\n                  },\n                  \"commission\": {\n                    \"description\": \"Maximum commission rate, 0–1 (0.08 = 8%).\",\n                    \"type\": \"number\"\n                  }\n                },\n                \"required\": [\n                  \"domain\",\n                  \"url\",\n                  \"price\",\n                  \"currency\",\n                  \"inStock\",\n                  \"commission\"\n                ]\n              }\n            },\n            \"brand\": {\n              \"type\": [\n                \"string\",\n                \"null\"\n              ]\n            },\n            \"image\": {\n              \"type\": [\n                \"string\",\n                \"null\"\n              ]\n            }\n          },\n          \"required\": [\n            \"productId\",\n            \"title\",\n            \"offers\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"null\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    \"created_at\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"format\": \"date-time\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"id\",\n    \"slug\",\n    \"status\",\n    \"product_type\",\n    \"price_cents\",\n    \"currency\",\n    \"spec\"\n  ]\n}"
                example: '{"id":"Hn2c8QvL0xTzR4pW","slug":"vintageskates","status":"live","product_type":"physical","price_cents":24000,"currency":"USD","shipping_cents":1500,"ship_countries":"US","stock":null,"delivery":"file","access_url":null,"paypal_email":"seller@example.com","seller_email":"seller@example.com","paypal_merchant_id":"7MZJ4QXN8K2LA","paypal_status":{"receivable":true,"emailConfirmed":true,"checkedAt":"2026-10-21T18:04:11Z"},"zapier_hook_url":null,"in_gallery":true,"account_id":"Vq3nN8cT0bLx2YwE","options":[{"name":"Size","kind":"size","values":[{"label":"7"},{"label":"8"},{"label":"9"}]}],"option_stock":{"7":3,"8":0,"9":6},"suggestions":null,"photo_blob":"LFRvGuTU3D8i334X","gallery_blobs":["zrySajNyao6_j11x","SuqcgNv64HWN8H6e"],"hero_blob":null,"hero_status":"none","hero_error":null,"ai_source":"gemini","source_url":null,"referral":null,"spec":{"productType":"physical","productName":"Vintage Cream and Red Roller Skates","layout":"editorial","palette":{"background":"#f6efe4","surface":"#fffaf2","text":"#2b1d14","muted":"#7a6455","accent":"#b3261e","accentText":"#ffffff"},"fonts":{"heading":"Playfair Display","body":"Inter"},"eyebrow":"One pair, restored","headline":"Classic quad skates crafted with walnut burl heels","subheadline":"A vintage pair of skates featuring cream leather, bold red trim, and durable quad wheels.","story":"Each pair combines soft cream leather with distinct red accents and a sculpted walnut burl heel base.","bullets":["Handmade cream leather upper with rich red trim","Sculpted walnut burl heel structure for stability"],"details":[{"label":"Materials","value":"Leather upper, walnut burl heel, rubber wheels"}],"faq":[{"q":"Are these suitable for outdoor skating?","a":"Yes, on indoor rink floors and paved outdoor paths."}],"ctaLabel":"Buy the skates","suggestedPriceUsd":240,"suggestedShippingUsd":15,"imageAlt":"Cream leather quad roller skates with red trim"},"created_at":"2026-10-19T15:22:08Z"}'
          '404':
            description: No such shop, or the admin token or API key doesn't match it.
            body:
              application/json:
                schema: |
                  {
                    "id": "Error",
                    "title": "Error",
                    "example": {
                      "error": "Shop not found."
                    },
                    "type": "object",
                    "properties": {
                      "error": {
                        "description": "A sentence you can show to a person.",
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      "field": {
                        "description": "The form field at fault, when there is one.",
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      "detail": {
                        "description": "The upstream service's own message, for debugging.",
                        "type": "string"
                      }
                    },
                    "required": [
                      "error"
                    ]
                  }
                example: '{"error":"Shop not found."}'
      patch:
        securedBy:
        - AdminToken
        - PlatformKey
        description: >
          Changes only the fields you send. Renaming `slug` keeps the old link working (it

          redirects). Set `status: live` to publish; a digital product needs its file (or, for

          access codes, `access_url`) first.
        headers:
          Content-Type:
            required: true
            displayName: Content-Type
            enum:
            - application/json
        body:
          application/json:
            schema: |
              {
                "id": "ShopUpdate",
                "title": "ShopUpdate",
                "examples": [
                  {
                    "Id": "golive",
                    "Name": "Go live",
                    "Value": "{\"status\":\"live\"}",
                    "ExternalValue": null,
                    "Description": null
                  },
                  {
                    "Id": "edit",
                    "Name": "Fix the AI's guesses",
                    "Value": "{\"price\":240,\"shipping\":15,\"ship_countries\":\"US,CA\",\"in_gallery\":true}",
                    "ExternalValue": null,
                    "Description": null
                  },
                  {
                    "Id": "sizes",
                    "Name": "Sizes with stock per size",
                    "Value": "{\"options\":[{\"name\":\"Size\",\"kind\":\"size\",\"values\":[{\"label\":\"7\"},{\"label\":\"8\"},{\"label\":\"9\"}]}],\"option_stock\":{\"7\":3,\"8\":0,\"9\":6}}",
                    "ExternalValue": null,
                    "Description": null
                  },
                  {
                    "Id": "facts",
                    "Name": "Answer what buyers will ask",
                    "Value": "{\"facts\":[{\"label\":\"Wheel size\",\"value\":\"57 mm\"}]}",
                    "ExternalValue": null,
                    "Description": null
                  }
                ],
                "example": {
                  "status": "live"
                },
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "slug": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "status": {
                    "title": "Status",
                    "type": "string",
                    "additionalProperties": false,
                    "enum": [
                      "draft",
                      "live"
                    ]
                  },
                  "product_type": {
                    "title": "ProductType",
                    "description": "`referral` only for shops created from Channel3.",
                    "type": "string",
                    "additionalProperties": false,
                    "enum": [
                      "physical",
                      "digital",
                      "referral"
                    ]
                  },
                  "price": {
                    "type": "number",
                    "minimum": 0.5,
                    "maximum": 10000.0
                  },
                  "shipping": {
                    "type": "number",
                    "minimum": 0.0,
                    "maximum": 500.0
                  },
                  "stock": {
                    "type": [
                      "integer",
                      "null"
                    ],
                    "minimum": 0.0,
                    "format": "int32"
                  },
                  "ship_countries": {
                    "type": [
                      "string",
                      "null"
                    ]
                  },
                  "delivery": {
                    "title": "Delivery1",
                    "type": "string",
                    "additionalProperties": false,
                    "enum": [
                      "file",
                      "access_code"
                    ]
                  },
                  "access_url": {
                    "type": [
                      "string",
                      "null"
                    ],
                    "format": "uri"
                  },
                  "paypal_email": {
                    "type": [
                      "string",
                      "null"
                    ],
                    "format": "email"
                  },
                  "seller_email": {
                    "type": [
                      "string",
                      "null"
                    ],
                    "format": "email"
                  },
                  "zapier_hook_url": {
                    "type": [
                      "string",
                      "null"
                    ],
                    "format": "uri"
                  },
                  "in_gallery": {
                    "description": "Feature the shop at `/gallery` while it's live. Off by default.",
                    "type": "boolean"
                  },
                  "options": {
                    "description": "What the buyer picks (physical products only), replacing the current options; `[]` removes them. With options, stock is counted per combination in `option_stock` and the shop's own `stock` is cleared. At most 60 combinations.",
                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {
                      "id": "ShopOption",
                      "title": "ShopOption",
                      "description": "Something the buyer picks, such as a size or a colour. The shop still sells one product.",
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "name": {
                          "example": "Size",
                          "type": "string",
                          "maxLength": 20
                        },
                        "kind": {
                          "title": "Kind",
                          "description": "`color` shows swatches, and the photo of the picked colour.",
                          "type": "string",
                          "additionalProperties": false,
                          "enum": [
                            "size",
                            "color",
                            "other"
                          ]
                        },
                        "values": {
                          "description": "",
                          "type": "array",
                          "items": {
                            "id": "OptionValue",
                            "title": "OptionValue",
                            "type": "object",
                            "properties": {
                              "label": {
                                "example": "M",
                                "type": "string",
                                "maxLength": 30
                              },
                              "hex": {
                                "example": "#14171a",
                                "type": "string",
                                "pattern": "^#[0-9a-fA-F]{6}$"
                              },
                              "photo": {
                                "description": "Colours: the shop photo (id) that shows this colour. See `matchColorPhotos`.",
                                "type": "string"
                              }
                            },
                            "required": [
                              "label"
                            ]
                          },
                          "minItems": 1,
                          "maxItems": 12
                        }
                      },
                      "required": [
                        "name",
                        "kind",
                        "values"
                      ]
                    },
                    "maxItems": 3
                  },
                  "option_stock": {
                    "description": "Stock per combination, keyed by its values in option order joined with ` / ` (e.g. `M / Black`). A missing key or `null` means unlimited; `0` is sold out.",
                    "example": {
                      "M / Black": 4,
                      "L / Black": 0
                    },
                    "type": "object",
                    "additionalProperties": {
                      "type": [
                        "integer",
                        "null"
                      ],
                      "format": "int32"
                    },
                    "minimum": 0.0
                  },
                  "facts": {
                    "description": "Answers to the \"buyers will ask\" questions in `suggestions.missingFacts`. Each becomes a product detail on the page (replacing one with the same label) and drops off the list.",
                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {
                      "id": "Fact",
                      "title": "Fact",
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "label": {
                          "example": "Size",
                          "type": "string",
                          "maxLength": 30
                        },
                        "value": {
                          "example": "US women's 8",
                          "type": "string",
                          "maxLength": 100
                        }
                      },
                      "required": [
                        "label",
                        "value"
                      ]
                    },
                    "maxItems": 5
                  }
                }
              }
            example: '{"status":"live"}'
        responses:
          '200':
            description: Saved.
            body:
              application/json:
                schema: |
                  {
                    "id": "ApiShopsResponse",
                    "title": "ApiShopsResponse",
                    "example": {
                      "ok": true,
                      "slug": "vintageskates"
                    },
                    "type": "object",
                    "properties": {
                      "ok": {
                        "type": "boolean"
                      },
                      "slug": {
                        "description": "The shop's link name after this change.",
                        "type": "string"
                      }
                    },
                    "required": [
                      "ok",
                      "slug"
                    ]
                  }
                example: '{"ok":true,"slug":"vintageskates"}'
          '400':
            description: Something in the request needs fixing; `error` says what.
            body:
              application/json:
                schema: |
                  {
                    "id": "Error",
                    "title": "Error",
                    "example": {
                      "error": "Choose a photo."
                    },
                    "type": "object",
                    "properties": {
                      "error": {
                        "description": "A sentence you can show to a person.",
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      "field": {
                        "description": "The form field at fault, when there is one.",
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      "detail": {
                        "description": "The upstream service's own message, for debugging.",
                        "type": "string"
                      }
                    },
                    "required": [
                      "error"
                    ]
                  }
                example: '{"error":"Choose a photo."}'
          '404':
            description: No such shop, or the admin token or API key doesn't match it.
            body:
              application/json:
                schema: |
                  {
                    "id": "Error",
                    "title": "Error",
                    "example": {
                      "error": "Shop not found."
                    },
                    "type": "object",
                    "properties": {
                      "error": {
                        "description": "A sentence you can show to a person.",
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      "field": {
                        "description": "The form field at fault, when there is one.",
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      "detail": {
                        "description": "The upstream service's own message, for debugging.",
                        "type": "string"
                      }
                    },
                    "required": [
                      "error"
                    ]
                  }
                example: '{"error":"Shop not found."}'
    post:
      securedBy:
      - null
      - PlatformKey
      description: >
        Starts a draft shop from one of three sources. Gemini designs the page and guesses the

        setup; check it with `getShop`, adjust with `updateShop`, then go live.


        Sent with a session cookie from `signIn`, the shop belongs to that account, which also

        becomes its seller email (and PayPal email, after Log in with PayPal) unless you give one.


        - `source=photo`: a `photo` and/or a `description` of your own product.

        - `source=link`: a `url`. If Channel3 recognises it as a store's product page, the shop
          becomes a recommendation (`product_type: referral`); otherwise the page is read and you
          sell the product yourself with PayPal.
        - `source=channel3`: a `productId` from `searchProducts` (a recommendation).


        Takes 15–40 seconds. Hero art, if available, is generated afterwards (`hero_status`).


        **Platforms:** sent with a platform API key, the shop belongs to the key's account, so the

        key can manage it from then on (no need to keep the admin token). It's made for one of the

        platform's sellers, so it inherits nothing from the account: set `paypal_email` or call

        `connectPayPal` for that seller.
      body:
        multipart/form-data:
          formParameters:
            source:
              required: true
              displayName: source
              enum:
              - photo
              - link
              - channel3
            photo:
              description: '`source=photo`: the product photo, up to 8 MB.'
              type: file
              required: false
              displayName: photo
            description:
              description: '`source=photo`: a sentence or two about the product. Required if there is no photo.'
              type: string
              required: false
              displayName: description
            url:
              description: '`source=link`: a product page, or your own app or game page.'
              type: string
              required: false
              displayName: url
            productId:
              description: '`source=channel3`: a product id from `searchProducts`.'
              type: string
              required: false
              displayName: productId
            slug:
              description: The link name you want. If omitted, the AI suggests one.
              type: string
              required: false
              displayName: slug
            type:
              default: auto
              required: false
              displayName: type
              enum:
              - auto
              - physical
              - digital
            delivery:
              description: For digital products. If omitted, the AI guesses.
              required: false
              displayName: delivery
              enum:
              - file
              - access_code
            access_url:
              description: Where buyers use an access code.
              type: string
              required: false
              displayName: access_url
            price:
              description: USD. If omitted, the AI suggests a price.
              type: number
              required: false
              displayName: price
            shipping:
              type: number
              required: false
              displayName: shipping
            stock:
              type: integer
              required: false
              displayName: stock
            ship_countries:
              type: string
              required: false
              displayName: ship_countries
            paypal_email:
              type: string
              required: false
              displayName: paypal_email
            seller_email:
              type: string
              required: false
              displayName: seller_email
            digital_file:
              type: file
              required: false
              displayName: digital_file
      responses:
        '200':
          description: Draft created.
          body:
            application/json:
              schema: |
                {
                  "id": "CreatedShop",
                  "title": "CreatedShop",
                  "example": {
                    "slug": "vintageskates",
                    "token": "3fJ9xQm2LwP8vR1tZk7cN4bY6dHs0aEu",
                    "manageUrl": "/manage/vintageskates?token=3fJ9xQm2LwP8vR1tZk7cN4bY6dHs0aEu"
                  },
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "slug": {
                      "example": "dragonflight",
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "token": {
                      "description": "The admin token. Shown once; store it.",
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "manageUrl": {
                      "description": "The seller's private manage page (contains the token).",
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "slug",
                    "token",
                    "manageUrl"
                  ]
                }
              example: '{"slug":"vintageskates","token":"3fJ9xQm2LwP8vR1tZk7cN4bY6dHs0aEu","manageUrl":"/manage/vintageskates?token=3fJ9xQm2LwP8vR1tZk7cN4bY6dHs0aEu"}'
        '400':
          description: Something in the request needs fixing; `error` says what.
          body:
            application/json:
              schema: |
                {
                  "id": "Error",
                  "title": "Error",
                  "example": {
                    "error": "Choose a photo."
                  },
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "error": {
                      "description": "A sentence you can show to a person.",
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "field": {
                      "description": "The form field at fault, when there is one.",
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "detail": {
                      "description": "The upstream service's own message, for debugging.",
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "error"
                  ]
                }
              example: '{"error":"Choose a photo."}'
        '409':
          description: Taken or unavailable (a link name, or a sold-out product).
          body:
            application/json:
              schema: |
                {
                  "id": "Error",
                  "title": "Error",
                  "example": {
                    "error": "Sold out."
                  },
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "error": {
                      "description": "A sentence you can show to a person.",
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "field": {
                      "description": "The form field at fault, when there is one.",
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "detail": {
                      "description": "The upstream service's own message, for debugging.",
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "error"
                  ]
                }
              example: '{"error":"Sold out."}'
        '502':
          description: Gemini, PayPal or Channel3 failed or isn't configured.
          body:
            application/json:
              schema: |
                {
                  "id": "Error",
                  "title": "Error",
                  "example": {
                    "error": "PayPal isn't configured on this server."
                  },
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "error": {
                      "description": "A sentence you can show to a person.",
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "field": {
                      "description": "The form field at fault, when there is one.",
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "detail": {
                      "description": "The upstream service's own message, for debugging.",
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "error"
                  ]
                }
              example: "{\"error\":\"PayPal isn't configured on this server.\"}"
        '429':
          description: Over this network's cap for the call (see **Limits**). Retry after `Retry-After` seconds.
          headers:
            Retry-After:
              required: false
          body:
            application/json:
              schema: |
                {
                  "id": "Error",
                  "title": "Error",
                  "example": {
                    "error": "Too many checkouts from your network. Try again in 7 min."
                  },
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "error": {
                      "description": "A sentence you can show to a person.",
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "field": {
                      "description": "The form field at fault, when there is one.",
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "detail": {
                      "description": "The upstream service's own message, for debugging.",
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "error"
                  ]
                }
              example: '{"error":"Too many checkouts from your network. Try again in 7 min."}'
  /slugs/check:
    get:
      description: Normalises a proposed link name and says whether a new shop can use it.
      queryParameters:
        name:
          description: Anything; it is normalised (`Raptor Rush` becomes `raptor-rush`).
          type: string
          example: Raptor Rush
          required: true
          displayName: name
      responses:
        '200':
          description: The normalised name and whether it can be used.
          body:
            application/json:
              schema: |
                {
                  "id": "ApiSlugsCheckResponse",
                  "title": "ApiSlugsCheckResponse",
                  "examples": [
                    {
                      "Id": "free",
                      "Name": "Available",
                      "Value": "{\"slug\":\"raptor-rush\",\"available\":true}",
                      "ExternalValue": null,
                      "Description": null
                    },
                    {
                      "Id": "taken",
                      "Name": "Taken",
                      "Value": "{\"slug\":\"raptorrush\",\"available\":false,\"problem\":\"Taken. Try another name.\"}",
                      "ExternalValue": null,
                      "Description": null
                    }
                  ],
                  "example": {
                    "slug": "raptor-rush",
                    "available": true
                  },
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "slug": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "available": {
                      "type": "boolean"
                    },
                    "problem": {
                      "description": "Why not, when unavailable.",
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "slug",
                    "available"
                  ]
                }
              example: '{"slug":"raptor-rush","available":true}'
  /channel3/search:
    get:
      description: Searches 100M+ products from 25k+ stores through Channel3. Pass a result's `id` to `createShop` with `source=channel3`.
      queryParameters:
        q:
          description: What to look for, in plain words.
          type: string
          example: gifts for trail runners under $60
          required: true
          displayName: q
          maxLength: '200'
      responses:
        '200':
          description: Up to 12 products.
          body:
            application/json:
              schema: |
                {
                  "id": "ApiChannel3SearchResponse",
                  "title": "ApiChannel3SearchResponse",
                  "example": {
                    "products": [
                      {
                        "id": "ch3_7f2a9c1e",
                        "title": "Trail Running Vest 5L",
                        "brand": "Salomon",
                        "image": "https://images.example.com/vest.jpg",
                        "price": 59.99,
                        "currency": "USD",
                        "retailer": "rei.com",
                        "retailers": 4,
                        "commission": 0.08
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "products": {
                      "description": "",
                      "type": "array",
                      "items": {
                        "id": "ProductCard",
                        "title": "ProductCard",
                        "type": "object",
                        "properties": {
                          "id": {
                            "type": "string"
                          },
                          "title": {
                            "type": "string"
                          },
                          "image": {
                            "type": "string"
                          },
                          "price": {
                            "type": "number"
                          },
                          "currency": {
                            "type": "string"
                          },
                          "retailer": {
                            "description": "The store with the best offer.",
                            "type": "string"
                          },
                          "retailers": {
                            "type": "integer",
                            "format": "int32"
                          },
                          "commission": {
                            "description": "Best commission rate across offers, 0–1.",
                            "type": "number"
                          },
                          "brand": {
                            "type": [
                              "string",
                              "null"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        "required": [
                          "id",
                          "title",
                          "image",
                          "price",
                          "currency",
                          "retailer",
                          "retailers",
                          "commission"
                        ]
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "products"
                  ]
                }
              example: '{"products":[{"id":"ch3_7f2a9c1e","title":"Trail Running Vest 5L","brand":"Salomon","image":"https://images.example.com/vest.jpg","price":59.99,"currency":"USD","retailer":"rei.com","retailers":4,"commission":0.08}]}'
        '502':
          description: Gemini, PayPal or Channel3 failed or isn't configured.
          body:
            application/json:
              schema: |
                {
                  "id": "Error",
                  "title": "Error",
                  "example": {
                    "error": "PayPal isn't configured on this server."
                  },
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "error": {
                      "description": "A sentence you can show to a person.",
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "field": {
                      "description": "The form field at fault, when there is one.",
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "detail": {
                      "description": "The upstream service's own message, for debugging.",
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "error"
                  ]
                }
              example: "{\"error\":\"PayPal isn't configured on this server.\"}"
        '503':
          description: Gemini, PayPal or Channel3 failed or isn't configured.
          body:
            application/json:
              schema: |
                {
                  "id": "Error",
                  "title": "Error",
                  "example": {
                    "error": "PayPal isn't configured on this server."
                  },
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "error": {
                      "description": "A sentence you can show to a person.",
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "field": {
                      "description": "The form field at fault, when there is one.",
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "detail": {
                      "description": "The upstream service's own message, for debugging.",
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "error"
                  ]
                }
              example: "{\"error\":\"PayPal isn't configured on this server.\"}"
  /paypal/client-token:
    get:
      description: >
        A browser-safe client token for the PayPal JavaScript SDK v6

        (`paypal.createInstance({ clientToken })`), bound to the requesting site's domain.

        Shop pages call this before showing the PayPal button.
      responses:
        '200':
          description: A token for this site's domain.
          body:
            application/json:
              schema: |
                {
                  "id": "ApiPaypalClientTokenResponse",
                  "title": "ApiPaypalClientTokenResponse",
                  "example": {
                    "clientToken": "eyJraWQiOiJFWEFNUExFIn0.example.client-token"
                  },
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "clientToken": {
                      "description": "Pass to `createInstance` in the PayPal JavaScript SDK v6.",
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "clientToken"
                  ]
                }
              example: '{"clientToken":"eyJraWQiOiJFWEFNUExFIn0.example.client-token"}'
        '502':
          description: Gemini, PayPal or Channel3 failed or isn't configured.
          body:
            application/json:
              schema: |
                {
                  "id": "Error",
                  "title": "Error",
                  "example": {
                    "error": "PayPal isn't configured on this server."
                  },
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "error": {
                      "description": "A sentence you can show to a person.",
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "field": {
                      "description": "The form field at fault, when there is one.",
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "detail": {
                      "description": "The upstream service's own message, for debugging.",
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "error"
                  ]
                }
              example: "{\"error\":\"PayPal isn't configured on this server.\"}"
        '503':
          description: Gemini, PayPal or Channel3 failed or isn't configured.
          body:
            application/json:
              schema: |
                {
                  "id": "Error",
                  "title": "Error",
                  "example": {
                    "error": "PayPal isn't configured on this server."
                  },
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "error": {
                      "description": "A sentence you can show to a person.",
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "field": {
                      "description": "The form field at fault, when there is one.",
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "detail": {
                      "description": "The upstream service's own message, for debugging.",
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "error"
                  ]
                }
              example: "{\"error\":\"PayPal isn't configured on this server.\"}"
  /orders:
    /{paypalOrderId}/capture:
      uriParameters:
        paypalOrderId:
          description: The PayPal order id that `createCheckoutOrder` returned.
          type: string
          example: 5O190127TN364715T
          required: true
          displayName: paypalOrderId
      post:
        description: >
          Call after the buyer approves. Records the sale; digital orders get a download link or access code.

          Safe to call repeatedly: before approval it answers 409, so a page can poll it while the PayPal window is open.
        responses:
          '200':
            description: Paid.
            body:
              application/json:
                schema: |
                  {
                    "id": "ApiOrdersCaptureResponse",
                    "title": "ApiOrdersCaptureResponse",
                    "example": {
                      "orderId": "pX4kR9tVb2nQ7sLe",
                      "status": "paid"
                    },
                    "type": "object",
                    "properties": {
                      "orderId": {
                        "description": "OneThing's order id; the thank-you page is `/<slug>/thanks?order=<orderId>`.",
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      "status": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "enum": [
                          "paid"
                        ]
                      }
                    },
                    "required": [
                      "orderId",
                      "status"
                    ]
                  }
                example: '{"orderId":"pX4kR9tVb2nQ7sLe","status":"paid"}'
          '402':
            description: Something in the request needs fixing; `error` says what.
            body:
              application/json:
                schema: |
                  {
                    "id": "Error",
                    "title": "Error",
                    "example": {
                      "error": "Choose a photo."
                    },
                    "type": "object",
                    "properties": {
                      "error": {
                        "description": "A sentence you can show to a person.",
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      "field": {
                        "description": "The form field at fault, when there is one.",
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      "detail": {
                        "description": "The upstream service's own message, for debugging.",
                        "type": "string"
                      }
                    },
                    "required": [
                      "error"
                    ]
                  }
                example: '{"error":"Choose a photo."}'
          '404':
            description: No such shop, or the admin token or API key doesn't match it.
            body:
              application/json:
                schema: |
                  {
                    "id": "Error",
                    "title": "Error",
                    "example": {
                      "error": "Shop not found."
                    },
                    "type": "object",
                    "properties": {
                      "error": {
                        "description": "A sentence you can show to a person.",
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      "field": {
                        "description": "The form field at fault, when there is one.",
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      "detail": {
                        "description": "The upstream service's own message, for debugging.",
                        "type": "string"
                      }
                    },
                    "required": [
                      "error"
                    ]
                  }
                example: '{"error":"Shop not found."}'
          '409':
            description: The buyer hasn't approved the order yet.
            body:
              application/json:
                schema: |
                  {
                    "id": "ApiOrdersCapture409Error1",
                    "title": "ApiOrdersCapture409Error1",
                    "type": "object",
                    "properties": {
                      "status": {
                        "title": "Status6",
                        "type": "string",
                        "additionalProperties": false,
                        "enum": [
                          "pending"
                        ]
                      }
                    }
                  }
          '410':
            description: The last unit (or the last of the buyer's combination) sold while they were paying, or the PayPal checkout expired before they paid. The payment isn't captured, so the buyer isn't charged.
            body:
              application/json:
                schema: |
                  {
                    "id": "Error",
                    "title": "Error",
                    "type": "object",
                    "properties": {
                      "error": {
                        "description": "A sentence you can show to a person.",
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      "field": {
                        "description": "The form field at fault, when there is one.",
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      "detail": {
                        "description": "The upstream service's own message, for debugging.",
                        "type": "string"
                      }
                    },
                    "required": [
                      "error"
                    ]
                  }
          '422':
            description: The buyer's funding source was declined (`INSTRUMENT_DECLINED`); they can try another.
            body:
              application/json:
                schema: |
                  {
                    "id": "Error",
                    "title": "Error",
                    "type": "object",
                    "properties": {
                      "error": {
                        "description": "A sentence you can show to a person.",
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      "field": {
                        "description": "The form field at fault, when there is one.",
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      "detail": {
                        "description": "The upstream service's own message, for debugging.",
                        "type": "string"
                      }
                    },
                    "required": [
                      "error"
                    ]
                  }
          '502':
            description: Gemini, PayPal or Channel3 failed or isn't configured.
            body:
              application/json:
                schema: |
                  {
                    "id": "Error",
                    "title": "Error",
                    "example": {
                      "error": "PayPal isn't configured on this server."
                    },
                    "type": "object",
                    "properties": {
                      "error": {
                        "description": "A sentence you can show to a person.",
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      "field": {
                        "description": "The form field at fault, when there is one.",
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      "detail": {
                        "description": "The upstream service's own message, for debugging.",
                        "type": "string"
                      }
                    },
                    "required": [
                      "error"
                    ]
                  }
                example: "{\"error\":\"PayPal isn't configured on this server.\"}"
    post:
      description: >
        Creates the PayPal order for one unit of a live shop's product. The amount always comes

        from the shop, never from the caller. Pass the returned `id` to the PayPal JS SDK.


        If the shop has buyer `options`, send one value for each. A sold-out combination answers 409.
      headers:
        Content-Type:
          required: true
          displayName: Content-Type
          enum:
          - application/json
      body:
        application/json:
          schema: |
            {
              "id": "ApiOrdersRequest",
              "title": "ApiOrdersRequest",
              "examples": [
                {
                  "Id": "plain",
                  "Name": "A product without options",
                  "Value": "{\"slug\":\"raptorrush\"}",
                  "ExternalValue": null,
                  "Description": null
                },
                {
                  "Id": "options",
                  "Name": "With the buyer's size",
                  "Value": "{\"slug\":\"vintageskates\",\"options\":{\"Size\":\"9\"}}",
                  "ExternalValue": null,
                  "Description": null
                }
              ],
              "example": {
                "slug": "raptorrush"
              },
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "slug": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "options": {
                  "description": "The buyer's pick, one value per option, keyed by option name.",
                  "example": {
                    "Size": "M",
                    "Color": "Black"
                  },
                  "type": "object",
                  "additionalProperties": {
                    "type": "string"
                  }
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "slug"
              ]
            }
          example: '{"slug":"raptorrush"}'
      responses:
        '200':
          description: PayPal order created.
          body:
            application/json:
              schema: |
                {
                  "id": "ApiOrdersResponse",
                  "title": "ApiOrdersResponse",
                  "example": {
                    "id": "5O190127TN364715T"
                  },
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "id": {
                      "description": "PayPal order id.",
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "id"
                  ]
                }
              example: '{"id":"5O190127TN364715T"}'
        '400':
          description: Something in the request needs fixing; `error` says what.
          body:
            application/json:
              schema: |
                {
                  "id": "Error",
                  "title": "Error",
                  "example": {
                    "error": "Choose a photo."
                  },
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "error": {
                      "description": "A sentence you can show to a person.",
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "field": {
                      "description": "The form field at fault, when there is one.",
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "detail": {
                      "description": "The upstream service's own message, for debugging.",
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "error"
                  ]
                }
              example: '{"error":"Choose a photo."}'
        '404':
          description: No such shop, or the admin token or API key doesn't match it.
          body:
            application/json:
              schema: |
                {
                  "id": "Error",
                  "title": "Error",
                  "example": {
                    "error": "Shop not found."
                  },
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "error": {
                      "description": "A sentence you can show to a person.",
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "field": {
                      "description": "The form field at fault, when there is one.",
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "detail": {
                      "description": "The upstream service's own message, for debugging.",
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "error"
                  ]
                }
              example: '{"error":"Shop not found."}'
        '409':
          description: Taken or unavailable (a link name, or a sold-out product).
          body:
            application/json:
              schema: |
                {
                  "id": "Error",
                  "title": "Error",
                  "example": {
                    "error": "Sold out."
                  },
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "error": {
                      "description": "A sentence you can show to a person.",
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "field": {
                      "description": "The form field at fault, when there is one.",
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "detail": {
                      "description": "The upstream service's own message, for debugging.",
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "error"
                  ]
                }
              example: '{"error":"Sold out."}'
        '502':
          description: Gemini, PayPal or Channel3 failed or isn't configured.
          body:
            application/json:
              schema: |
                {
                  "id": "Error",
                  "title": "Error",
                  "example": {
                    "error": "PayPal isn't configured on this server."
                  },
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "error": {
                      "description": "A sentence you can show to a person.",
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "field": {
                      "description": "The form field at fault, when there is one.",
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "detail": {
                      "description": "The upstream service's own message, for debugging.",
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "error"
                  ]
                }
              example: "{\"error\":\"PayPal isn't configured on this server.\"}"
        '503':
          description: Gemini, PayPal or Channel3 failed or isn't configured.
          body:
            application/json:
              schema: |
                {
                  "id": "Error",
                  "title": "Error",
                  "example": {
                    "error": "PayPal isn't configured on this server."
                  },
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "error": {
                      "description": "A sentence you can show to a person.",
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "field": {
                      "description": "The form field at fault, when there is one.",
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "detail": {
                      "description": "The upstream service's own message, for debugging.",
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "error"
                  ]
                }
              example: "{\"error\":\"PayPal isn't configured on this server.\"}"
        '429':
          description: Over this network's cap for the call (see **Limits**). Retry after `Retry-After` seconds.
          headers:
            Retry-After:
              required: false
          body:
            application/json:
              schema: |
                {
                  "id": "Error",
                  "title": "Error",
                  "example": {
                    "error": "Too many checkouts from your network. Try again in 7 min."
                  },
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "error": {
                      "description": "A sentence you can show to a person.",
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "field": {
                      "description": "The form field at fault, when there is one.",
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "detail": {
                      "description": "The upstream service's own message, for debugging.",
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "error"
                  ]
                }
              example: '{"error":"Too many checkouts from your network. Try again in 7 min."}'
  /access/verify:
    post:
      description: >
        For apps and games sold with access codes. Callable from any origin (CORS `*`): it only

        answers valid or not for one shop, and counts uses. Accepts the shop's current or former

        link names, and codes typed loosely (lower case, spaces, no dashes).
      headers:
        Content-Type:
          required: true
          displayName: Content-Type
          enum:
          - application/json
      body:
        application/json:
          schema: |
            {
              "id": "ApiAccessVerifyRequest",
              "title": "ApiAccessVerifyRequest",
              "example": {
                "shop": "raptorrush",
                "code": "K7QF-M2XP-9HTD"
              },
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "shop": {
                  "description": "The shop's link name.",
                  "example": "raptorrush",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "code": {
                  "example": "K7QF-M2XP-9HTD",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "shop",
                "code"
              ]
            }
          example: '{"shop":"raptorrush","code":"K7QF-M2XP-9HTD"}'
      responses:
        '200':
          description: The answer. Invalid codes are also a 200.
          body:
            application/json:
              schema: |
                {
                  "id": "ApiAccessVerifyResponse",
                  "title": "ApiAccessVerifyResponse",
                  "examples": [
                    {
                      "Id": "valid",
                      "Name": "A valid code",
                      "Value": "{\"valid\":true,\"product\":\"Raptor Rush: Browser Edition\"}",
                      "ExternalValue": null,
                      "Description": null
                    },
                    {
                      "Id": "invalid",
                      "Name": "A wrong code",
                      "Value": "{\"valid\":false}",
                      "ExternalValue": null,
                      "Description": null
                    }
                  ],
                  "example": {
                    "valid": true,
                    "product": "Raptor Rush: Browser Edition"
                  },
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "valid": {
                      "type": "boolean"
                    },
                    "product": {
                      "description": "The product name, when valid.",
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "valid"
                  ]
                }
              example: '{"valid":true,"product":"Raptor Rush: Browser Edition"}'
  /download/{token}:
    uriParameters:
      token:
        description: The download token from a paid order's thank-you page.
        type: string
        example: q2Vd8mLx0RkT4nYb7HcW1sPe
        required: true
        displayName: token
    get:
      description: A paid digital order's private link. Works 5 times within 14 days.
      responses:
        '200':
          description: The file.
        '410':
          description: Expired or used up.
          body:
            text/plain:
              schema: |
                {
                  "type": "string"
                }
  /blobs/{id}:
    uriParameters:
      id:
        description: A shop's `photo_blob` or `hero_blob`.
        type: string
        example: 'LFRvGuTU3D8i334X'
        required: true
        displayName: id
    get:
      description: Public images only. Purchased files are never served here.
      responses:
        '200':
          description: The image.
          body:
            text/plain:
              schema: |
                {
                  "x-is-dynamic": true
                }
        '404':
          description: Not a public shop image.
  /mcp:
    post:
      description: >
        A [Model Context Protocol](https://modelcontextprotocol.io) server, so agents such as

        Claude can shop here. Add `https://<host>/api/mcp` to an MCP client as a Streamable HTTP

        server. It's stateless: each POST carries one JSON-RPC 2.0 message (or a batch) and gets a

        plain JSON reply, with no event stream. The `initialize` reply's `Mcp-Session-Id` header

        carries the client's `clientInfo.name`; send it back on later requests (MCP clients do)

        so the seller's stats show which agent sent the buyer. Nothing else is kept.


        Methods: `initialize`, `ping`, `tools/list`, `tools/call`, and `resources/list`,

        `resources/templates/list` and `resources/read` for the product card. Each tool carries

        `annotations` (only `create_order` isn't `readOnlyHint`). Tools:


        | Tool | Arguments | What it does |

        |---|---|---|

        | `search_shops` | `query?`, `limit?` (1–25) | Live gallery shops, best match first; no match returns the newest with `matched: false` |

        | `get_product` | `shop` | The same object as `getAgentProduct` |

        | `create_order` | `shop`, `options?` | One unit on order; returns `order_id` and `pay_url` |

        | `get_order` | `order_id` | Status and `next_step`; once paid, the receipt and `delivery` |


        **The buyer always approves.** `create_order` charges nothing: the agent shows the buyer

        `pay_url` (`/o/<order_id>`, see `openPayLink`), which opens PayPal. It's a plain link on this

        site, so agent platforms that hide PayPal's checkout tokens can still show it. When the buyer

        says they've paid, the agent calls `get_order`.


        `get_order` status is one of `awaiting_buyer_approval`, `paid`, `declined` (nothing charged;

        the buyer can open `pay_url` again), `sold_out`, `expired` (call `create_order` again) or

        `failed` (PayPal couldn't be reached; try again), with a `next_step` the agent can follow.

        A paid order carries `delivery`: `{type: access_code, access_code, start_url?}`,

        `{type: download, download_url}` or `{type: shipping, ship_to, fulfillment, tracking}`, plus

        `amount` with item, shipping and total. Orders made this way show `channel: agent` in

        `listOrders`.


        **The product card.** Hosts that draw MCP Apps UI (ChatGPT, or a client that declares the

        `io.modelcontextprotocol/ui` extension) get `search_shops`, `get_product` and

        `create_order` results as a card with the real photos, options and a Pay with PayPal button

        (`ui://onething/shop-card-v1.html`). For them `show_buyer` is a one-line note rather than

        Markdown, so the model doesn't repeat or invent what the card shows.


        Tool errors (an unknown shop, a sold-out size, over the checkout cap) come back as results

        with `isError: true`, so the model can read them and try something else.
      headers:
        Content-Type:
          required: true
          displayName: Content-Type
          enum:
          - application/json
      body:
        application/json:
          schema: |
            {
              "examples": [
                {
                  "Id": "search",
                  "Name": "Find a shop",
                  "Value": "{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"id\":1,\"method\":\"tools/call\",\"params\":{\"name\":\"search_shops\",\"arguments\":{\"query\":\"game\"}}}",
                  "ExternalValue": null,
                  "Description": null
                },
                {
                  "Id": "initialize",
                  "Name": "Start (handshake)",
                  "Value": "{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"id\":0,\"method\":\"initialize\",\"params\":{\"protocolVersion\":\"2025-06-18\",\"capabilities\":{},\"clientInfo\":{\"name\":\"my-agent\",\"version\":\"1.0\"}}}",
                  "ExternalValue": null,
                  "Description": null
                },
                {
                  "Id": "list",
                  "Name": "List the tools",
                  "Value": "{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"id\":3,\"method\":\"tools/list\"}",
                  "ExternalValue": null,
                  "Description": null
                },
                {
                  "Id": "product",
                  "Name": "Read one product",
                  "Value": "{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"id\":4,\"method\":\"tools/call\",\"params\":{\"name\":\"get_product\",\"arguments\":{\"shop\":\"vintageskates\"}}}",
                  "ExternalValue": null,
                  "Description": null
                },
                {
                  "Id": "order",
                  "Name": "Order a size and colour",
                  "Value": "{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"id\":2,\"method\":\"tools/call\",\"params\":{\"name\":\"create_order\",\"arguments\":{\"shop\":\"trailtee\",\"options\":{\"Size\":\"M\",\"Color\":\"Black\"}}}}",
                  "ExternalValue": null,
                  "Description": null
                },
                {
                  "Id": "status",
                  "Name": "Check an order",
                  "Value": "{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"id\":5,\"method\":\"tools/call\",\"params\":{\"name\":\"get_order\",\"arguments\":{\"order_id\":\"pX4kR9tVb2nQ7sLe\"}}}",
                  "ExternalValue": null,
                  "Description": null
                }
              ],
              "example": {
                "jsonrpc": "2.0",
                "id": 1,
                "method": "tools/call",
                "params": {
                  "name": "search_shops",
                  "arguments": {
                    "query": "game"
                  }
                }
              },
              "oneOf": [
                {
                  "id": "JsonRpcRequest",
                  "title": "JsonRpcRequest",
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "jsonrpc": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "enum": [
                        "2.0"
                      ]
                    },
                    "method": {
                      "title": "Method",
                      "type": "string",
                      "additionalProperties": false,
                      "enum": [
                        "initialize",
                        "ping",
                        "tools/list",
                        "tools/call",
                        "notifications/initialized"
                      ]
                    },
                    "id": {
                      "description": "Leave out for a notification.",
                      "oneOf": [
                        {
                          "type": "string"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "integer",
                          "format": "int32"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "null"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    "params": {
                      "description": "For `tools/call`: `{ name, arguments }`.",
                      "type": "object"
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "jsonrpc",
                    "method"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "array",
                  "items": {
                    "id": "JsonRpcRequest",
                    "title": "JsonRpcRequest",
                    "type": "object",
                    "properties": {
                      "jsonrpc": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "enum": [
                          "2.0"
                        ]
                      },
                      "method": {
                        "title": "Method",
                        "type": "string",
                        "additionalProperties": false,
                        "enum": [
                          "initialize",
                          "ping",
                          "tools/list",
                          "tools/call",
                          "notifications/initialized"
                        ]
                      },
                      "id": {
                        "description": "Leave out for a notification.",
                        "oneOf": [
                          {
                            "type": "string"
                          },
                          {
                            "type": "integer",
                            "format": "int32"
                          },
                          {
                            "type": "null"
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      "params": {
                        "description": "For `tools/call`: `{ name, arguments }`.",
                        "type": "object"
                      }
                    },
                    "required": [
                      "jsonrpc",
                      "method"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          example: '{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"search_shops","arguments":{"query":"game"}}}'
      responses:
        '200':
          description: The JSON-RPC reply (an array for a batch).
          body:
            application/json:
              schema: "{\n  \"x-is-dynamic\": true,\n  \"examples\": [\n    {\n      \"Id\": \"search\",\n      \"Name\": \"search_shops\",\n      \"Value\": \"{\\\"jsonrpc\\\":\\\"2.0\\\",\\\"id\\\":1,\\\"result\\\":{\\\"content\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"{\\\\n  \\\\\\\"show_buyer\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"![Vintage Cream and Red Roller Skates](https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/api/blobs/LFRvGuTU3D8i334X)\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n**Vintage Cream and Red Roller Skates**: $240.00. Classic quad skates crafted with walnut burl heels\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nWant it?\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"shops\\\\\\\": [\\\\n    {\\\\n      \\\\\\\"shop\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"vintageskates\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Vintage Cream and Red Roller Skates\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"kind\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"physical\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"headline\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Classic quad skates crafted with walnut burl heels\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"price\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"$240.00\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"image\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/api/blobs/LFRvGuTU3D8i334X\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"url\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/vintageskates\\\\\\\"\\\\n    }\\\\n  ],\\\\n  \\\\\\\"agent_name\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Claude\\\\\\\"\\\\n}\\\"}],\\\"structuredContent\\\":{\\\"show_buyer\\\":\\\"![Vintage Cream and Red Roller Skates](https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/api/blobs/LFRvGuTU3D8i334X)\\\\n\\\\n**Vintage Cream and Red Roller Skates**: $240.00. Classic quad skates crafted with walnut burl heels\\\\n\\\\nWant it?\\\",\\\"shops\\\":[{\\\"shop\\\":\\\"vintageskates\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Vintage Cream and Red Roller Skates\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"physical\\\",\\\"headline\\\":\\\"Classic quad skates crafted with walnut burl heels\\\",\\\"price\\\":\\\"$240.00\\\",\\\"image\\\":\\\"https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/api/blobs/LFRvGuTU3D8i334X\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/vintageskates\\\"}],\\\"agent_name\\\":\\\"Claude\\\"},\\\"isError\\\":false}}\",\n      \"ExternalValue\": null,\n      \"Description\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"Id\": \"order\",\n      \"Name\": \"create_order\",\n      \"Value\": \"{\\\"jsonrpc\\\":\\\"2.0\\\",\\\"id\\\":2,\\\"result\\\":{\\\"content\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"{\\\\n  \\\\\\\"order_id\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"pX4kR9tVb2nQ7sLe\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"awaiting_buyer_approval\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"total\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"$255.00\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"options\\\\\\\": {\\\\n    \\\\\\\"Size\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"9\\\\\\\"\\\\n  },\\\\n  \\\\\\\"pay_url\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/o/pX4kR9tVb2nQ7sLe\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"status_url\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/o/pX4kR9tVb2nQ7sLe/status\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"next_step\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Show pay_url to the buyer as a link. It opens PayPal, where they pay (and enter a shipping address for physical items). When they say they've paid, call get_order with order_id: it returns the access code, download link or shipping details.\\\\\\\"\\\\n}\\\"}],\\\"structuredContent\\\":{\\\"order_id\\\":\\\"pX4kR9tVb2nQ7sLe\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"awaiting_buyer_approval\\\",\\\"total\\\":\\\"$255.00\\\",\\\"options\\\":{\\\"Size\\\":\\\"9\\\"},\\\"pay_url\\\":\\\"https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/o/pX4kR9tVb2nQ7sLe\\\",\\\"status_url\\\":\\\"https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/o/pX4kR9tVb2nQ7sLe/status\\\",\\\"next_step\\\":\\\"Show pay_url to the buyer as a link. It opens PayPal, where they pay (and enter a shipping address for physical items). When they say they've paid, call get_order with order_id: it returns the access code, download link or shipping details.\\\"},\\\"isError\\\":false}}\",\n      \"ExternalValue\": null,\n      \"Description\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"Id\": \"status\",\n      \"Name\": \"get_order, paid\",\n      \"Value\": \"{\\\"jsonrpc\\\":\\\"2.0\\\",\\\"id\\\":5,\\\"result\\\":{\\\"content\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"{\\\\n  \\\\\\\"order_id\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"pX4kR9tVb2nQ7sLe\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"paid\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"product\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Vintage Cream and Red Roller Skates\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"options\\\\\\\": {\\\\n    \\\\\\\"Size\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"9\\\\\\\"\\\\n  },\\\\n  \\\\\\\"amount\\\\\\\": {\\\\n    \\\\\\\"item\\\\\\\": 240,\\\\n    \\\\\\\"shipping\\\\\\\": 15,\\\\n    \\\\\\\"total\\\\\\\": 255,\\\\n    \\\\\\\"currency\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"USD\\\\\\\"\\\\n  },\\\\n  \\\\\\\"total\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"$255.00\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"paid_at\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"2026-10-22T02:41:37Z\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"receipt_url\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/vintageskates/thanks?order=pX4kR9tVb2nQ7sLe\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"delivery\\\\\\\": {\\\\n    \\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"shipping\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"ship_to\\\\\\\": {\\\\n      \\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Sam Rivera\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"address\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"1 Main St, Springfield, IL, 62701, US\\\\\\\"\\\\n    },\\\\n    \\\\\\\"fulfillment\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"to_ship\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"tracking\\\\\\\": null\\\\n  }\\\\n}\\\"}],\\\"structuredContent\\\":{\\\"order_id\\\":\\\"pX4kR9tVb2nQ7sLe\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"paid\\\",\\\"product\\\":\\\"Vintage Cream and Red Roller Skates\\\",\\\"options\\\":{\\\"Size\\\":\\\"9\\\"},\\\"amount\\\":{\\\"item\\\":240,\\\"shipping\\\":15,\\\"total\\\":255,\\\"currency\\\":\\\"USD\\\"},\\\"total\\\":\\\"$255.00\\\",\\\"paid_at\\\":\\\"2026-10-22T02:41:37Z\\\",\\\"receipt_url\\\":\\\"https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/vintageskates/thanks?order=pX4kR9tVb2nQ7sLe\\\",\\\"delivery\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"shipping\\\",\\\"ship_to\\\":{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Sam Rivera\\\",\\\"address\\\":\\\"1 Main St, Springfield, IL, 62701, US\\\"},\\\"fulfillment\\\":\\\"to_ship\\\",\\\"tracking\\\":null}},\\\"isError\\\":false}}\",\n      \"ExternalValue\": null,\n      \"Description\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"Id\": \"toolError\",\n      \"Name\": \"A tool error the model can read\",\n      \"Value\": \"{\\\"jsonrpc\\\":\\\"2.0\\\",\\\"id\\\":2,\\\"result\\\":{\\\"content\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"{\\\\n  \\\\\\\"error\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"9 / Black is sold out.\\\\\\\"\\\\n}\\\"}],\\\"isError\\\":true}}\",\n      \"ExternalValue\": null,\n      \"Description\": null\n    }\n  ],\n  \"example\": {\n    \"jsonrpc\": \"2.0\",\n    \"id\": 1,\n    \"result\": {\n      \"content\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"text\",\n          \"text\": \"{\\n  \\\"show_buyer\\\": \\\"![Vintage Cream and Red Roller Skates](https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/api/blobs/LFRvGuTU3D8i334X)\\\\n\\\\n**Vintage Cream and Red Roller Skates**: $240.00. Classic quad skates crafted with walnut burl heels\\\\n\\\\nWant it?\\\",\\n  \\\"shops\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"shop\\\": \\\"vintageskates\\\",\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"Vintage Cream and Red Roller Skates\\\",\\n      \\\"kind\\\": \\\"physical\\\",\\n      \\\"headline\\\": \\\"Classic quad skates crafted with walnut burl heels\\\",\\n      \\\"price\\\": \\\"$240.00\\\",\\n      \\\"image\\\": \\\"https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/api/blobs/LFRvGuTU3D8i334X\\\",\\n      \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/vintageskates\\\"\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"agent_name\\\": \\\"Claude\\\"\\n}\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"structuredContent\": {\n        \"show_buyer\": \"![Vintage Cream and Red Roller Skates](https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/api/blobs/LFRvGuTU3D8i334X)\\n\\n**Vintage Cream and Red Roller Skates**: $240.00. Classic quad skates crafted with walnut burl heels\\n\\nWant it?\",\n        \"shops\": [\n          {\n            \"shop\": \"vintageskates\",\n            \"name\": \"Vintage Cream and Red Roller Skates\",\n            \"kind\": \"physical\",\n            \"headline\": \"Classic quad skates crafted with walnut burl heels\",\n            \"price\": \"$240.00\",\n            \"image\": \"https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/api/blobs/LFRvGuTU3D8i334X\",\n            \"url\": \"https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/vintageskates\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"agent_name\": \"Claude\"\n      },\n      \"isError\": false\n    }\n  },\n  \"oneOf\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"JsonRpcResponse\",\n      \"title\": \"JsonRpcResponse\",\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"jsonrpc\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"enum\": [\n            \"2.0\"\n          ]\n        },\n        \"id\": {\n          \"oneOf\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"string\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"integer\",\n              \"format\": \"int32\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"null\"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        \"result\": {\n          \"description\": \"For `tools/call`: `content` (the answer as JSON text), `structuredContent` (the same object) and `isError`.\",\n          \"type\": \"object\"\n        },\n        \"error\": {\n          \"id\": \"Error1\",\n          \"title\": \"Error1\",\n          \"type\": \"object\",\n          \"properties\": {\n            \"code\": {\n              \"example\": -32601,\n              \"type\": \"integer\",\n              \"format\": \"int32\"\n            },\n            \"message\": {\n              \"type\": \"string\"\n            }\n          },\n          \"required\": [\n            \"code\",\n            \"message\"\n          ]\n        }\n      },\n      \"required\": [\n        \"jsonrpc\",\n        \"id\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"id\": \"JsonRpcResponse\",\n        \"title\": \"JsonRpcResponse\",\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"jsonrpc\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"enum\": [\n              \"2.0\"\n            ]\n          },\n          \"id\": {\n            \"oneOf\": [\n              {\n                \"type\": \"string\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"type\": \"integer\",\n                \"format\": \"int32\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"type\": \"null\"\n              }\n            ]\n          },\n          \"result\": {\n            \"description\": \"For `tools/call`: `content` (the answer as JSON text), `structuredContent` (the same object) and `isError`.\",\n            \"type\": \"object\"\n          },\n          \"error\": {\n            \"id\": \"Error1\",\n            \"title\": \"Error1\",\n            \"type\": \"object\",\n            \"properties\": {\n              \"code\": {\n                \"example\": -32601,\n                \"type\": \"integer\",\n                \"format\": \"int32\"\n              },\n              \"message\": {\n                \"type\": \"string\"\n              }\n            },\n            \"required\": [\n              \"code\",\n              \"message\"\n            ]\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"jsonrpc\",\n          \"id\"\n        ]\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}"
              example: '{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"show_buyer\": \"![Vintage Cream and Red Roller Skates](https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/api/blobs/LFRvGuTU3D8i334X)\\n\\n**Vintage Cream and Red Roller Skates**: $240.00. Classic quad skates crafted with walnut burl heels\\n\\nWant it?\",\n  \"shops\": [\n    {\n      \"shop\": \"vintageskates\",\n      \"name\": \"Vintage Cream and Red Roller Skates\",\n      \"kind\": \"physical\",\n      \"headline\": \"Classic quad skates crafted with walnut burl heels\",\n      \"price\": \"$240.00\",\n      \"image\": \"https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/api/blobs/LFRvGuTU3D8i334X\",\n      \"url\": \"https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/vintageskates\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"agent_name\": \"Claude\"\n}"}],"structuredContent":{"show_buyer":"![Vintage Cream and Red Roller Skates](https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/api/blobs/LFRvGuTU3D8i334X)\n\n**Vintage Cream and Red Roller Skates**: $240.00. Classic quad skates crafted with walnut burl heels\n\nWant it?","shops":[{"shop":"vintageskates","name":"Vintage Cream and Red Roller Skates","kind":"physical","headline":"Classic quad skates crafted with walnut burl heels","price":"$240.00","image":"https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/api/blobs/LFRvGuTU3D8i334X","url":"https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/vintageskates"}],"agent_name":"Claude"},"isError":false}}'
        '202':
          description: Only notifications were sent; there's nothing to reply.
        '400':
          description: Not JSON (JSON-RPC parse error `-32700`).
          body:
            application/json:
              schema: |
                {
                  "id": "JsonRpcResponse",
                  "title": "JsonRpcResponse",
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "jsonrpc": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "enum": [
                        "2.0"
                      ]
                    },
                    "id": {
                      "oneOf": [
                        {
                          "type": "string"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "integer",
                          "format": "int32"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "null"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    "result": {
                      "description": "For `tools/call`: `content` (the answer as JSON text), `structuredContent` (the same object) and `isError`.",
                      "type": "object"
                    },
                    "error": {
                      "id": "Error1",
                      "title": "Error1",
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "code": {
                          "example": -32601,
                          "type": "integer",
                          "format": "int32"
                        },
                        "message": {
                          "type": "string"
                        }
                      },
                      "required": [
                        "code",
                        "message"
                      ]
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "jsonrpc",
                    "id"
                  ]
                }
  /platform/shops:
    get:
      securedBy:
      - PlatformKey
      description: "Every shop the API key's account owns, newest first, with what a catalog page needs: name, price, cover, link, whether PayPal is connected and how many sales it has."
      queryParameters:
        status:
          description: Only shops with this status, e.g. `live` for a public catalog.
          example: live
          required: false
          displayName: status
          enum:
          - draft
          - live
      responses:
        '200':
          description: The shops.
          body:
            application/json:
              schema: |
                {
                  "id": "ApiPlatformShopsResponse",
                  "title": "ApiPlatformShopsResponse",
                  "example": {
                    "shops": [
                      {
                        "slug": "raptorrush",
                        "status": "live",
                        "name": "Raptor Rush: Browser Edition",
                        "headline": "Grow from Tiny Hatchling to Giant Apex Predator",
                        "product_type": "digital",
                        "price": {
                          "amount": 2.99,
                          "currency": "USD"
                        },
                        "url": "https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/raptorrush",
                        "cover": "https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/api/blobs/KchAi9jwZzo76SKh",
                        "paypal_connected": true,
                        "sales": 12,
                        "created_at": "2026-10-12T20:31:44Z"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "shops": {
                      "description": "",
                      "type": "array",
                      "items": {
                        "id": "PlatformShop",
                        "title": "PlatformShop",
                        "type": "object",
                        "properties": {
                          "slug": {
                            "type": "string"
                          },
                          "status": {
                            "title": "Status",
                            "type": "string",
                            "additionalProperties": false,
                            "enum": [
                              "draft",
                              "live"
                            ]
                          },
                          "name": {
                            "type": "string"
                          },
                          "product_type": {
                            "title": "ProductType1",
                            "type": "string",
                            "additionalProperties": false,
                            "enum": [
                              "physical",
                              "digital",
                              "referral"
                            ]
                          },
                          "price": {
                            "id": "AgentMoney",
                            "title": "AgentMoney",
                            "type": "object",
                            "properties": {
                              "amount": {
                                "example": 48.5,
                                "type": "number"
                              },
                              "currency": {
                                "example": "USD",
                                "type": "string"
                              },
                              "label": {
                                "example": "$48.50",
                                "type": "string"
                              }
                            },
                            "required": [
                              "amount",
                              "currency"
                            ]
                          },
                          "url": {
                            "description": "The shop page buyers pay on.",
                            "type": "string"
                          },
                          "paypal_connected": {
                            "description": "The seller connected a PayPal account that can be paid.",
                            "type": "boolean"
                          },
                          "sales": {
                            "description": "Paid orders.",
                            "type": "integer",
                            "format": "int32"
                          },
                          "created_at": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "format": "date-time"
                          },
                          "headline": {
                            "type": "string"
                          },
                          "cover": {
                            "description": "The cover image's URL.",
                            "type": [
                              "string",
                              "null"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        "required": [
                          "slug",
                          "status",
                          "name",
                          "product_type",
                          "price",
                          "url",
                          "paypal_connected",
                          "sales",
                          "created_at"
                        ]
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "shops"
                  ]
                }
              example: '{"shops":[{"slug":"raptorrush","status":"live","name":"Raptor Rush: Browser Edition","headline":"Grow from Tiny Hatchling to Giant Apex Predator","product_type":"digital","price":{"amount":2.99,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/raptorrush","cover":"https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/api/blobs/KchAi9jwZzo76SKh","paypal_connected":true,"sales":12,"created_at":"2026-10-12T20:31:44Z"}]}'
        '401':
          description: No API key, or it's wrong or revoked.
          body:
            application/json:
              schema: |
                {
                  "id": "Error",
                  "title": "Error",
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "error": {
                      "description": "A sentence you can show to a person.",
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "field": {
                      "description": "The form field at fault, when there is one.",
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "detail": {
                      "description": "The upstream service's own message, for debugging.",
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "error"
                  ]
                }
  /account:
    /signin:
      post:
        description: Signs in with an email address or a phone number, creating the account the first time. There's no password and no verification (sandbox). The response sets the `ot_session` cookie; shops created with it belong to the account and are listed on `/account`. Signing in with an email also claims older shops whose seller email matches. In a browser, sellers can instead use Log in with PayPal (`/api/account/paypal`), which also records the PayPal account their sales are paid into.
        headers:
          Content-Type:
            required: true
            displayName: Content-Type
            enum:
            - application/json
        body:
          application/json:
            schema: |
              {
                "id": "ApiAccountSigninRequest",
                "title": "ApiAccountSigninRequest",
                "examples": [
                  {
                    "Id": "email",
                    "Name": "With an email",
                    "Value": "{\"identifier\":\"maker@example.com\"}",
                    "ExternalValue": null,
                    "Description": null
                  },
                  {
                    "Id": "phone",
                    "Name": "With a phone number",
                    "Value": "{\"identifier\":\"+1 555 123 4567\"}",
                    "ExternalValue": null,
                    "Description": null
                  }
                ],
                "example": {
                  "identifier": "maker@example.com"
                },
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "identifier": {
                    "description": "An email address, or a phone number (spaces, dashes and brackets are ignored; keep a leading +).",
                    "examples": [
                      {
                        "Id": "Untitled Example1",
                        "Name": null,
                        "Value": "maker@example.com",
                        "ExternalValue": null,
                        "Description": null
                      },
                      {
                        "Id": "Untitled Example2",
                        "Name": null,
                        "Value": "+1 555 123 4567",
                        "ExternalValue": null,
                        "Description": null
                      }
                    ],
                    "example": "maker@example.com",
                    "type": "string"
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "identifier"
                ]
              }
            example: '{"identifier":"maker@example.com"}'
        responses:
          '200':
            description: Signed in. The `ot_session` cookie is set.
            headers:
              Set-Cookie:
                required: false
            body:
              application/json:
                schema: |
                  {
                    "id": "ApiAccountSigninResponse",
                    "title": "ApiAccountSigninResponse",
                    "example": {
                      "id": "Vq3nN8cT0bLx2YwE",
                      "email": "maker@example.com",
                      "phone": null
                    },
                    "type": "object",
                    "properties": {
                      "id": {
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      "email": {
                        "description": "Lower-cased.",
                        "type": [
                          "string",
                          "null"
                        ]
                      },
                      "phone": {
                        "description": "Digits, with a leading + if one was given.",
                        "type": [
                          "string",
                          "null"
                        ]
                      }
                    },
                    "required": [
                      "id",
                      "email",
                      "phone"
                    ]
                  }
                example: '{"id":"Vq3nN8cT0bLx2YwE","email":"maker@example.com","phone":null}'
          '400':
            description: Something in the request needs fixing; `error` says what.
            body:
              application/json:
                schema: |
                  {
                    "id": "Error",
                    "title": "Error",
                    "example": {
                      "error": "Choose a photo."
                    },
                    "type": "object",
                    "properties": {
                      "error": {
                        "description": "A sentence you can show to a person.",
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      "field": {
                        "description": "The form field at fault, when there is one.",
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      "detail": {
                        "description": "The upstream service's own message, for debugging.",
                        "type": "string"
                      }
                    },
                    "required": [
                      "error"
                    ]
                  }
                example: '{"error":"Choose a photo."}'
    /signout:
      post:
        description: Ends this browser's session and clears the `ot_session` cookie.
        responses:
          '200':
            description: Done.
            body:
              application/json:
                schema: |
                  {
                    "id": "Ok",
                    "title": "Ok",
                    "example": {
                      "ok": true
                    },
                    "type": "object",
                    "properties": {
                      "ok": {
                        "type": "boolean"
                      }
                    },
                    "required": [
                      "ok"
                    ]
                  }
                example: '{"ok":true}'
    /paypal:
      get:
        description: "A link for a browser, not for code: redirects to PayPal's sign-in page. PayPal sends the seller back to `/api/account/paypal/callback`, which signs them in (creating the account the first time), records the PayPal account their sales are paid into, and redirects to `next`."
        queryParameters:
          next:
            description: A path on this site to land on afterwards. Defaults to `/account`.
            type: string
            example: /new
            required: false
            displayName: next
        responses:
          '302':
            description: To PayPal's sign-in page.
          '503':
            description: Log in with PayPal isn't switched on for this server.
            body:
              application/json:
                schema: |
                  {
                    "id": "Error",
                    "title": "Error",
                    "type": "object",
                    "properties": {
                      "error": {
                        "description": "A sentence you can show to a person.",
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      "field": {
                        "description": "The form field at fault, when there is one.",
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      "detail": {
                        "description": "The upstream service's own message, for debugging.",
                        "type": "string"
                      }
                    },
                    "required": [
                      "error"
                    ]
                  }
  /agent:
    /shops:
      /{slug}:
        uriParameters:
          slug:
            description: The shop's link name (current or former).
            type: string
            example: raptorrush
            required: true
            displayName: slug
        /order:
          uriParameters: {}
          get:
            description: >
              Orders one unit with a GET: the MCP `create_order` tool for AI assistants that can only

              fetch URLs, such as free-tier ChatGPT or Grok. Nothing is charged. The reply has `pay_url`,

              where the buyer pays at PayPal, and `status_url` (`getAgentOrder`), which says when they

              have and what they got.


              For a product with options, pass the buyer's pick as query parameters named after the

              options (`?Size=9`, or `?Color=Ice+Blue&Size=L`); names and values are matched without

              regard to case. You rarely build this URL yourself: `getAgentProduct` and `/llms.txt`

              write it out in full (`order_url`, or `variants[].order_url`), because some assistants

              only open URLs they have been shown.


              Every request makes a new order, so open it once, after the buyer says to buy. Known

              crawlers and link previewers get a 403 (and are kept out by `robots.txt`); any other

              leaves an unpaid order at most, since stock is only taken when a payment is captured.

              Replies are `no-store` and `X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow`.


              `/<slug>/buy` is the same endpoint at a short URL, and the one `order_url` uses.

              A person clicking the link in a browser (`Sec-Fetch-User: ?1`) is redirected instead; known assistants and headless browsers always get JSON. It goes straight to `pay_url`, or to the shop page when an option is missing

              or unknown.
            queryParameters:
              agent:
                description: "Optional: the agent's name (`ChatGPT`, `Gemini`, `my-shopping-bot`), so the seller's stats show which agent sent the buyer. Only used when the user agent doesn't already say."
                type: string
                example: ChatGPT
                required: false
                displayName: agent
                maxLength: '30'
              Size:
                description: An example option. The real parameter names are the product's option names from `getAgentProduct` (`options[].name`), one per option.
                type: string
                example: '9'
                required: false
                displayName: Size
            responses:
              '200':
                description: The order, waiting for the buyer to pay.
                body:
                  application/json:
                    schema: "{\n  \"id\": \"AgentCreatedOrder\",\n  \"title\": \"AgentCreatedOrder\",\n  \"description\": \"A new order, as `create_order` and `orderByLink` return it.\",\n  \"example\": {\n    \"show_buyer\": \"![Vintage Cream and Red Roller Skates](https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/api/blobs/LFRvGuTU3D8i334X)\\n\\nVintage Cream and Red Roller Skates (9): $255.00 total.\\n**[Pay $255.00 with PayPal](https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/o/pX4kR9tVb2nQ7sLe)**\\nTell me once you've paid and I'll get you the shipping confirmation.\",\n    \"order_id\": \"pX4kR9tVb2nQ7sLe\",\n    \"status\": \"awaiting_buyer_approval\",\n    \"total\": \"$255.00\",\n    \"options\": {\n      \"Size\": \"9\"\n    },\n    \"pay_url\": \"https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/o/pX4kR9tVb2nQ7sLe\",\n    \"status_url\": \"https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/o/pX4kR9tVb2nQ7sLe/status\",\n    \"next_step\": \"Show pay_url to the buyer as a link. It opens PayPal, where they pay (and enter a shipping address for physical items). When they say they've paid, open status_url (or with MCP, call get_order with order_id): it returns the access code, download link or shipping details.\"\n  },\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"order_id\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"status\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"enum\": [\n        \"awaiting_buyer_approval\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"total\": {\n      \"description\": \"The total with shipping, as a label.\",\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"pay_url\": {\n      \"description\": \"Where the buyer pays (redirects to PayPal). Safe to show in chat.\",\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"status_url\": {\n      \"description\": \"`getAgentOrder` for this order.\",\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"next_step\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"show_buyer\": {\n      \"description\": \"A suggested reply to the buyer, in Markdown with the links already written as links: the product and its options to pick from, the pay link, or what they got with a receipt link. Buyers have the best experience when agents show it as written.\",\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"agent_name\": {\n      \"description\": \"Who this request was credited to in the seller's stats: a recognised user agent, else the name the agent gave itself (`?agent=`, or the MCP client's name), else the user agent's first word.\",\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"options\": {\n      \"description\": \"The buyer's pick, one value per option, keyed by option name.\",\n      \"example\": {\n        \"Size\": \"M\",\n        \"Color\": \"Black\"\n      },\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"additionalProperties\": {\n        \"type\": \"string\"\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"order_id\",\n    \"status\",\n    \"total\",\n    \"pay_url\",\n    \"status_url\",\n    \"next_step\"\n  ]\n}"
                    example: '{"show_buyer":"![Vintage Cream and Red Roller Skates](https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/api/blobs/LFRvGuTU3D8i334X)\n\nVintage Cream and Red Roller Skates (9): $255.00 total.\n**[Pay $255.00 with PayPal](https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/o/pX4kR9tVb2nQ7sLe)**\nTell me once you''ve paid and I''ll get you the shipping confirmation.","order_id":"pX4kR9tVb2nQ7sLe","status":"awaiting_buyer_approval","total":"$255.00","options":{"Size":"9"},"pay_url":"https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/o/pX4kR9tVb2nQ7sLe","status_url":"https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/o/pX4kR9tVb2nQ7sLe/status","next_step":"Show pay_url to the buyer as a link. It opens PayPal, where they pay (and enter a shipping address for physical items). When they say they''ve paid, open status_url (or with MCP, call get_order with order_id): it returns the access code, download link or shipping details."}'
              '303':
                description: A person clicked the link. Redirect to PayPal (`pay_url`), or to the shop page to pick an option.
                headers:
                  Location:
                    required: false
              '400':
                description: A missing or unknown option value, or sold out. `error` names the valid values.
                body:
                  application/json:
                    schema: |
                      {
                        "id": "Error",
                        "title": "Error",
                        "example": {
                          "error": "Unknown Size \"12\". Size: one of 7, 8, 9."
                        },
                        "type": "object",
                        "properties": {
                          "error": {
                            "description": "A sentence you can show to a person.",
                            "type": "string"
                          },
                          "field": {
                            "description": "The form field at fault, when there is one.",
                            "type": "string"
                          },
                          "detail": {
                            "description": "The upstream service's own message, for debugging.",
                            "type": "string"
                          }
                        },
                        "required": [
                          "error"
                        ]
                      }
                    example: '{"error":"Unknown Size \"12\". Size: one of 7, 8, 9."}'
              '403':
                description: A known crawler or link previewer. They don't place orders.
                body:
                  application/json:
                    schema: |
                      {
                        "id": "Error",
                        "title": "Error",
                        "example": {
                          "error": "Crawlers and link previews don't place orders. Read the product at the shop's page."
                        },
                        "type": "object",
                        "properties": {
                          "error": {
                            "description": "A sentence you can show to a person.",
                            "type": "string"
                          },
                          "field": {
                            "description": "The form field at fault, when there is one.",
                            "type": "string"
                          },
                          "detail": {
                            "description": "The upstream service's own message, for debugging.",
                            "type": "string"
                          }
                        },
                        "required": [
                          "error"
                        ]
                      }
                    example: "{\"error\":\"Crawlers and link previews don't place orders. Read the product at the shop's page.\"}"
              '404':
                description: No live shop with that link name.
                body:
                  application/json:
                    schema: |
                      {
                        "id": "Error",
                        "title": "Error",
                        "example": {
                          "error": "No live shop called \"skatez\". Try search_shops."
                        },
                        "type": "object",
                        "properties": {
                          "error": {
                            "description": "A sentence you can show to a person.",
                            "type": "string"
                          },
                          "field": {
                            "description": "The form field at fault, when there is one.",
                            "type": "string"
                          },
                          "detail": {
                            "description": "The upstream service's own message, for debugging.",
                            "type": "string"
                          }
                        },
                        "required": [
                          "error"
                        ]
                      }
                    example: '{"error":"No live shop called \"skatez\". Try search_shops."}'
              '429':
                description: Over this network's cap for the call (see **Limits**). Retry after `Retry-After` seconds.
                headers:
                  Retry-After:
                    required: false
                body:
                  application/json:
                    schema: |
                      {
                        "id": "Error",
                        "title": "Error",
                        "example": {
                          "error": "Too many checkouts from your network. Try again in 7 min."
                        },
                        "type": "object",
                        "properties": {
                          "error": {
                            "description": "A sentence you can show to a person.",
                            "type": "string"
                          },
                          "field": {
                            "description": "The form field at fault, when there is one.",
                            "type": "string"
                          },
                          "detail": {
                            "description": "The upstream service's own message, for debugging.",
                            "type": "string"
                          }
                        },
                        "required": [
                          "error"
                        ]
                      }
                    example: '{"error":"Too many checkouts from your network. Try again in 7 min."}'
        get:
          description: 'Everything an AI shopping agent needs to describe the product and decide to buy it: price, shipping, delivery, availability, options, images and FAQ. Public. Buying goes through the MCP server named in `mcp_server`, or the `order_url` links. Shop pages also carry the same facts as schema.org `Product` JSON-LD. A person clicking the link in a browser (`Sec-Fetch-User: ?1`) is redirected instead; known assistants and headless browsers always get JSON. It goes to the shop page, unless the link has `?view=json`.'
          queryParameters:
            agent:
              description: "Optional: the agent's name (`ChatGPT`, `Gemini`, `my-shopping-bot`), so the seller's stats show which agent sent the buyer. Only used when the user agent doesn't already say."
              type: string
              example: ChatGPT
              required: false
              displayName: agent
              maxLength: '30'
            view:
              description: '`json` keeps the JSON for a person opening the link in a browser.'
              example: json
              required: false
              displayName: view
              enum:
              - json
          responses:
            '200':
              description: The product.
              body:
                application/json:
                  schema: "{\n  \"id\": \"AgentProduct\",\n  \"title\": \"AgentProduct\",\n  \"description\": \"A live shop as an AI agent sees it. Recommendations have `offers`; everything else has `price` and is bought with `create_order`.\",\n  \"example\": {\n    \"show_buyer\": \"![Vintage Cream and Red Roller Skates](https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/api/blobs/LFRvGuTU3D8i334X)\\n\\n**Vintage Cream and Red Roller Skates**: $240.00 + $15.00 shipping\\nClassic quad skates crafted with walnut burl heels\\nSize: 7 · 8 · 9\\nWhich size?\",\n    \"shop\": \"vintageskates\",\n    \"url\": \"https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/vintageskates\",\n    \"name\": \"Vintage Cream and Red Roller Skates\",\n    \"kind\": \"physical\",\n    \"headline\": \"Classic quad skates crafted with walnut burl heels\",\n    \"description\": \"A vintage pair of skates featuring cream leather, bold red trim, and durable quad wheels.\",\n    \"highlights\": [\n      \"Handmade cream leather upper with rich red trim\",\n      \"Sculpted walnut burl heel structure for stability\"\n    ],\n    \"details\": [\n      {\n        \"label\": \"Materials\",\n        \"value\": \"Leather upper, walnut burl heel, rubber wheels\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"faq\": [\n      {\n        \"q\": \"What is the return policy?\",\n        \"a\": \"Unworn skates in original condition can be returned within 30 days of delivery.\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"images\": [\n      \"https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/api/blobs/LFRvGuTU3D8i334X\",\n      \"https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/api/blobs/zrySajNyao6_j11x\"\n    ],\n    \"price\": {\n      \"amount\": 240,\n      \"currency\": \"USD\",\n      \"label\": \"$240.00\"\n    },\n    \"shipping\": {\n      \"amount\": 15,\n      \"currency\": \"USD\",\n      \"ships_to\": [\n        \"US\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"total\": {\n      \"amount\": 255,\n      \"currency\": \"USD\"\n    },\n    \"delivery\": \"Shipped. PayPal collects the buyer's address at checkout.\",\n    \"options\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Size\",\n        \"values\": [\n          \"7\",\n          \"8\",\n          \"9\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"variants\": [\n      {\n        \"choice\": {\n          \"Size\": \"7\"\n        },\n        \"availability\": \"in_stock (3 left)\",\n        \"order_url\": \"https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/vintageskates/buy?Size=7\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"choice\": {\n          \"Size\": \"8\"\n        },\n        \"availability\": \"sold_out\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"choice\": {\n          \"Size\": \"9\"\n        },\n        \"availability\": \"in_stock (6 left)\",\n        \"order_url\": \"https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/vintageskates/buy?Size=9\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"in_stock\",\n    \"how_to_buy\": \"Show show_buyer to the buyer exactly as written, photo included (it's Markdown, so the photo displays and the links stay clickable), and keep your own words to a minimum. Once the buyer has picked and said to buy, open the order_url of their variant (or call create_order on the OneThing MCP server with shop and options). Either returns show_buyer with the pay link.\",\n    \"mcp_server\": \"https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/api/mcp\",\n    \"agent_name\": \"ChatGPT\"\n  },\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"shop\": {\n      \"description\": \"The link name, which the MCP tools take as `shop`.\",\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"url\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"name\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"kind\": {\n      \"title\": \"Kind1\",\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"additionalProperties\": false,\n      \"enum\": [\n        \"physical\",\n        \"digital\",\n        \"referral\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"headline\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"description\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"highlights\": {\n      \"description\": \"\",\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"string\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"details\": {\n      \"description\": \"\",\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"id\": \"Detail\",\n        \"title\": \"Detail\",\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"label\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"value\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"label\",\n          \"value\"\n        ]\n      }\n    },\n    \"faq\": {\n      \"description\": \"\",\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"id\": \"Faq\",\n        \"title\": \"Faq\",\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"q\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"a\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"q\",\n          \"a\"\n        ]\n      }\n    },\n    \"images\": {\n      \"description\": \"\",\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"string\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"how_to_buy\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"show_buyer\": {\n      \"description\": \"A suggested reply to the buyer, in Markdown with the links already written as links: the product and its options to pick from, the pay link, or what they got with a receipt link. Buyers have the best experience when agents show it as written.\",\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"agent_name\": {\n      \"description\": \"Who this request was credited to in the seller's stats: a recognised user agent, else the name the agent gave itself (`?agent=`, or the MCP client's name), else the user agent's first word.\",\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"price\": {\n      \"id\": \"AgentMoney\",\n      \"title\": \"AgentMoney\",\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"amount\": {\n          \"example\": 48.5,\n          \"type\": \"number\"\n        },\n        \"currency\": {\n          \"example\": \"USD\",\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"label\": {\n          \"example\": \"$48.50\",\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"required\": [\n        \"amount\",\n        \"currency\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"shipping\": {\n      \"description\": \"Physical products only.\",\n      \"oneOf\": [\n        {\n          \"id\": \"Shipping\",\n          \"title\": \"Shipping\",\n          \"type\": \"object\",\n          \"properties\": {\n            \"amount\": {\n              \"type\": \"number\"\n            },\n            \"currency\": {\n              \"type\": \"string\"\n            },\n            \"ships_to\": {\n              \"description\": \"Country codes; empty means anywhere PayPal ships.\",\n              \"type\": \"array\",\n              \"items\": {\n                \"type\": \"string\"\n              }\n            }\n          },\n          \"required\": [\n            \"amount\",\n            \"currency\",\n            \"ships_to\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"null\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    \"total\": {\n      \"$ref\": \"AgentMoney\"\n    },\n    \"delivery\": {\n      \"example\": \"Shipped. PayPal collects the buyer's address at checkout.\",\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"availability\": {\n      \"examples\": [\n        {\n          \"Id\": \"Untitled Example1\",\n          \"Name\": null,\n          \"Value\": \"in_stock\",\n          \"ExternalValue\": null,\n          \"Description\": null\n        },\n        {\n          \"Id\": \"Untitled Example2\",\n          \"Name\": null,\n          \"Value\": \"in_stock (3 left)\",\n          \"ExternalValue\": null,\n          \"Description\": null\n        },\n        {\n          \"Id\": \"Untitled Example3\",\n          \"Name\": null,\n          \"Value\": \"sold_out\",\n          \"ExternalValue\": null,\n          \"Description\": null\n        }\n      ],\n      \"example\": \"in_stock\",\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"options\": {\n      \"description\": \"Pass one value per option to `create_order`.\",\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"id\": \"Option1\",\n        \"title\": \"Option1\",\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"name\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"values\": {\n            \"description\": \"\",\n            \"type\": \"array\",\n            \"items\": {\n              \"type\": \"string\"\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"name\",\n          \"values\"\n        ]\n      }\n    },\n    \"variants\": {\n      \"description\": \"\",\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"id\": \"Variant\",\n        \"title\": \"Variant\",\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"choice\": {\n            \"description\": \"The buyer's pick, one value per option, keyed by option name.\",\n            \"example\": {\n              \"Size\": \"M\",\n              \"Color\": \"Black\"\n            },\n            \"type\": \"object\",\n            \"additionalProperties\": {\n              \"type\": \"string\"\n            }\n          },\n          \"availability\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"order_url\": {\n            \"description\": \"`orderByLink` for this pick. Left out when it's sold out.\",\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"choice\",\n          \"availability\"\n        ]\n      }\n    },\n    \"order_url\": {\n      \"description\": \"Products without options: `orderByLink`, which orders one unit with a GET. Left out when sold out. With options, each variant has its own.\",\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"offers\": {\n      \"description\": \"Recommendations only. Bought at the retailer.\",\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"id\": \"Offer1\",\n        \"title\": \"Offer1\",\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"retailer\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"price\": {\n            \"type\": \"number\"\n          },\n          \"currency\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"in_stock\": {\n            \"type\": \"boolean\"\n          },\n          \"url\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"retailer\",\n          \"price\",\n          \"currency\",\n          \"in_stock\",\n          \"url\"\n        ]\n      }\n    },\n    \"mcp_server\": {\n      \"description\": \"The MCP server to order through (`getAgentProduct` only).\",\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"shop\",\n    \"url\",\n    \"name\",\n    \"kind\",\n    \"headline\",\n    \"description\",\n    \"highlights\",\n    \"details\",\n    \"faq\",\n    \"images\",\n    \"how_to_buy\"\n  ]\n}"
                  example: '{"show_buyer":"![Vintage Cream and Red Roller Skates](https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/api/blobs/LFRvGuTU3D8i334X)\n\n**Vintage Cream and Red Roller Skates**: $240.00 + $15.00 shipping\nClassic quad skates crafted with walnut burl heels\nSize: 7 · 8 · 9\nWhich size?","shop":"vintageskates","url":"https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/vintageskates","name":"Vintage Cream and Red Roller Skates","kind":"physical","headline":"Classic quad skates crafted with walnut burl heels","description":"A vintage pair of skates featuring cream leather, bold red trim, and durable quad wheels.","highlights":["Handmade cream leather upper with rich red trim","Sculpted walnut burl heel structure for stability"],"details":[{"label":"Materials","value":"Leather upper, walnut burl heel, rubber wheels"}],"faq":[{"q":"What is the return policy?","a":"Unworn skates in original condition can be returned within 30 days of delivery."}],"images":["https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/api/blobs/LFRvGuTU3D8i334X","https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/api/blobs/zrySajNyao6_j11x"],"price":{"amount":240,"currency":"USD","label":"$240.00"},"shipping":{"amount":15,"currency":"USD","ships_to":["US"]},"total":{"amount":255,"currency":"USD"},"delivery":"Shipped. PayPal collects the buyer''s address at checkout.","options":[{"name":"Size","values":["7","8","9"]}],"variants":[{"choice":{"Size":"7"},"availability":"in_stock (3 left)","order_url":"https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/vintageskates/buy?Size=7"},{"choice":{"Size":"8"},"availability":"sold_out"},{"choice":{"Size":"9"},"availability":"in_stock (6 left)","order_url":"https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/vintageskates/buy?Size=9"}],"availability":"in_stock","how_to_buy":"Show show_buyer to the buyer exactly as written, photo included (it''s Markdown, so the photo displays and the links stay clickable), and keep your own words to a minimum. Once the buyer has picked and said to buy, open the order_url of their variant (or call create_order on the OneThing MCP server with shop and options). Either returns show_buyer with the pay link.","mcp_server":"https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/api/mcp","agent_name":"ChatGPT"}'
            '303':
              description: A person clicked the link. Redirect to the shop page (`/<slug>`).
            '404':
              description: No live shop with that link name.
              body:
                application/json:
                  schema: |
                    {
                      "id": "Error",
                      "title": "Error",
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "error": {
                          "description": "A sentence you can show to a person.",
                          "type": "string"
                        },
                        "field": {
                          "description": "The form field at fault, when there is one.",
                          "type": "string"
                        },
                        "detail": {
                          "description": "The upstream service's own message, for debugging.",
                          "type": "string"
                        }
                      },
                      "required": [
                        "error"
                      ]
                    }
      get:
        description: "The gallery's live shops for a query: shops matching more of its words first, newest first among equals. Browsing words (\"something interesting to buy\") are ignored, and a query that matches nothing returns the newest shops with `matched: false` rather than an empty list. The GET twin of the MCP `search_shops` tool, for agents that can only fetch URLs. Public. Read a shop with `getAgentProduct`; buy through the MCP server in `mcp_server`, or send the buyer to the shop's `url`."
        queryParameters:
          q:
            description: Keywords. Leave out to list the newest shops.
            type: string
            example: skates
            required: false
            displayName: q
            maxLength: '200'
          limit:
            description: How many shops, 1–25.
            type: integer
            example: '10'
            default: '10'
            required: false
            displayName: limit
            minimum: '1'
            maximum: '25'
        responses:
          '200':
            description: The matching shops.
            body:
              application/json:
                schema: "{\n  \"id\": \"ApiAgentShopsResponse\",\n  \"title\": \"ApiAgentShopsResponse\",\n  \"example\": {\n    \"show_buyer\": \"![Vintage Cream and Red Roller Skates](https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/api/blobs/LFRvGuTU3D8i334X)\\n\\n**Vintage Cream and Red Roller Skates**: $240.00. Classic quad skates crafted with walnut burl heels\\n\\n![Raptor Rush: Browser Edition](https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/api/blobs/R9tWc3yN6bJq1zUd)\\n\\n**Raptor Rush: Browser Edition**: $2.99. Grow from Tiny Hatchling to Giant Apex Predator\\n\\nWhich one?\",\n    \"shops\": [\n      {\n        \"shop\": \"vintageskates\",\n        \"name\": \"Vintage Cream and Red Roller Skates\",\n        \"kind\": \"physical\",\n        \"headline\": \"Classic quad skates crafted with walnut burl heels\",\n        \"price\": \"$240.00\",\n        \"image\": \"https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/api/blobs/LFRvGuTU3D8i334X\",\n        \"url\": \"https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/vintageskates\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"shop\": \"raptorrush\",\n        \"name\": \"Raptor Rush: Browser Edition\",\n        \"kind\": \"digital\",\n        \"headline\": \"Grow from Tiny Hatchling to Giant Apex Predator\",\n        \"price\": \"$2.99\",\n        \"image\": \"https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/api/blobs/R9tWc3yN6bJq1zUd\",\n        \"url\": \"https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/raptorrush\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"matched\": true,\n    \"mcp_server\": \"https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/api/mcp\"\n  },\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"show_buyer\": {\n      \"description\": \"A suggested reply to the buyer, in Markdown: each shop's cover photo as an image, its name, price and headline, then \\\"Which one?\\\". Chats that block images from other sites just leave the image lines out.\",\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"shops\": {\n      \"description\": \"\",\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"id\": \"AgentShopSummary\",\n        \"title\": \"AgentShopSummary\",\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"shop\": {\n            \"description\": \"The link name, for `getAgentProduct` and the MCP tools.\",\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"name\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"kind\": {\n            \"title\": \"Kind1\",\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"additionalProperties\": false,\n            \"enum\": [\n              \"physical\",\n              \"digital\",\n              \"referral\"\n            ]\n          },\n          \"headline\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"price\": {\n            \"description\": \"The price label, e.g. `$2.99`; null for recommendations.\",\n            \"type\": [\n              \"string\",\n              \"null\"\n            ]\n          },\n          \"image\": {\n            \"description\": \"The cover photo's URL (WebP; the retailer's image for a recommendation), or null when there's none.\",\n            \"type\": [\n              \"string\",\n              \"null\"\n            ]\n          },\n          \"url\": {\n            \"description\": \"The shop page.\",\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"shop\",\n          \"name\",\n          \"kind\",\n          \"headline\",\n          \"price\",\n          \"image\",\n          \"url\"\n        ]\n      }\n    },\n    \"matched\": {\n      \"description\": \"False when nothing matched the query and `shops` is the newest gallery shops instead; `show_buyer` then starts by saying so.\",\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"mcp_server\": {\n      \"description\": \"The MCP server to order through.\",\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"show_buyer\",\n    \"shops\",\n    \"matched\",\n    \"mcp_server\"\n  ]\n}"
                example: '{"show_buyer":"![Vintage Cream and Red Roller Skates](https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/api/blobs/LFRvGuTU3D8i334X)\n\n**Vintage Cream and Red Roller Skates**: $240.00. Classic quad skates crafted with walnut burl heels\n\n![Raptor Rush: Browser Edition](https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/api/blobs/R9tWc3yN6bJq1zUd)\n\n**Raptor Rush: Browser Edition**: $2.99. Grow from Tiny Hatchling to Giant Apex Predator\n\nWhich one?","shops":[{"shop":"vintageskates","name":"Vintage Cream and Red Roller Skates","kind":"physical","headline":"Classic quad skates crafted with walnut burl heels","price":"$240.00","image":"https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/api/blobs/LFRvGuTU3D8i334X","url":"https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/vintageskates"},{"shop":"raptorrush","name":"Raptor Rush: Browser Edition","kind":"digital","headline":"Grow from Tiny Hatchling to Giant Apex Predator","price":"$2.99","image":"https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/api/blobs/R9tWc3yN6bJq1zUd","url":"https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/raptorrush"}],"matched":true,"mcp_server":"https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/api/mcp"}'
    /orders/{orderId}:
      uriParameters:
        orderId:
          description: The `order_id` from the MCP `create_order` tool, or from a thank-you page link (`?order=`).
          type: string
          example: pX4kR9tVb2nQ7sLe
          required: true
          displayName: orderId
      get:
        description: "Where an order stands and, once paid, what the buyer got: the access code, the download link, or the shipping address and tracking. The GET twin of the MCP `get_order` tool (and the `status_url` that `create_order` returns), for agents that can only fetch URLs. Public: anyone with the order id can already open its thank-you page. If the buyer has approved at PayPal but nothing has captured the payment yet, this captures it. `/o/<order_id>/status` is the same endpoint at a short URL, and the one `status_url` uses. A person clicking the link in a browser (`Sec-Fetch-User: ?1`) is redirected instead; known assistants and headless browsers always get JSON. It goes to the order's receipt page."
        queryParameters:
          agent:
            description: "Optional: the agent's name (`ChatGPT`, `Gemini`, `my-shopping-bot`), so the seller's stats show which agent sent the buyer. Only used when the user agent doesn't already say."
            type: string
            example: ChatGPT
            required: false
            displayName: agent
            maxLength: '30'
        responses:
          '200':
            description: The order.
            body:
              application/json:
                schema: |
                  {
                    "id": "AgentOrder",
                    "title": "AgentOrder",
                    "description": "An order as `get_order` and `getAgentOrder` report it.",
                    "examples": [
                      {
                        "Id": "waiting",
                        "Name": "Waiting for the buyer",
                        "Value": "{\"order_id\":\"pX4kR9tVb2nQ7sLe\",\"status\":\"awaiting_buyer_approval\",\"product\":\"Vintage Cream and Red Roller Skates\",\"options\":{\"Size\":\"9\"},\"amount\":{\"item\":240,\"shipping\":15,\"total\":255,\"currency\":\"USD\"},\"total\":\"$255.00\",\"pay_url\":\"https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/o/pX4kR9tVb2nQ7sLe\",\"next_step\":\"The buyer hasn't paid yet. Give them pay_url; when they say they've paid, call get_order again.\"}",
                        "ExternalValue": null,
                        "Description": null
                      },
                      {
                        "Id": "code",
                        "Name": "Paid: an access code",
